  "facts": {
    "README.md": "# Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication\n\nShared CShells authentication composition for Orbyss Foundation. The feature binds shell-scoped web\nconfiguration, validates that exactly one authentication profile is active, maps provider roles and\nscopes to canonical application permissions, and supplies a replaceable authentication error writer.\n`Authority` remains the issuer and browser-facing origin; deployments that need a different\nserver-side route may set `BackchannelAuthority` for metadata retrieval without weakening issuer\nvalidation.\n\nApplications activate a concrete profile feature rather than this package directly; the BFF-cookie\nand SPA-PKCE features declare it as a dependency.\n\n`Foundation:Web:Scopes` is a complete selection, not an addition to the defaults. For example,\n`[\"openid\", \"profile\", \"offline_access\", \"consumer-api\"]` requests exactly those four scopes.\nWhen `Scopes` is omitted, the compatibility defaults remain `openid`, `profile`, `offline_access`,\nand `orbyss-foundation-api`. Consumers with a different API scope should supply their complete list;\n`[\"openid\"]` is a valid minimal selection and does not implicitly request profile or offline access.\n\nAn explicit empty array, null, scalar, malformed indexed array, missing `openid`, duplicate, or\ninvalid token fails options validation. Each entry must be one case-sensitive OAuth scope token\n([RFC 6749 section 3.3](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6749#section-3.3)); whitespace, quotes,\nbackslashes and non-ASCII characters are rejected. Invalid selections never restore defaults.\nThese rules apply to the effective shell configuration after configuration-provider precedence:\nstandard IConfiguration providers merge indexed keys across sources, so deploy a complete shell\nselection rather than relying on a shorter array in a later provider to delete earlier indices.\nRecreate the shell to apply configuration changes to its authentication handlers.\n\nThe shell also registers the replaceable `IValidatedAccountIdentityReader`. Adapt an authenticated\n`ClaimsPrincipal` through this service before translating its result to an application account.\nAdmission requires exactly one identity, that identity authenticated, and exactly one nonempty\n`AuthenticationClaimTypes.ValidatedIssuer` / `ValidatedSubject` pair. Duplicate or conflicting\nclaims, additional identities and unauthenticated identities are rejected. The projection retains\nexact ordinal issuer/subject values and does not decide resource ownership.\n\nThe immutable value and stable claim/error vocabulary are exported by the framework-light\n`Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.Core` package. Role and permission configuration cannot select\nreserved projection claim names. Authentication errors use the shared Problem Details integration;\napplications can replace the reader or the authentication error writer through DI.\n",
    "lib/net10.0/Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.xml": "<?xml version=\"1.0\"?>\n<doc>\n    <assembly>\n        <name>Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication</name>\n    </assembly>\n    <members>\n        <member name=\"T:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.DefaultAuthenticationErrorWriter\">\n            <summary>Writes the default RFC 9457-compatible authentication error representation.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.DefaultAuthenticationErrorWriter.WriteAsync(Microsoft.AspNetCore.Http.HttpContext,System.Int32,System.String)\">\n            <inheritdoc />\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"T:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.FoundationAuthenticationFeature\">\n            <summary>Composes profile-independent authentication and permission services into a shell.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.FoundationAuthenticationFeature.#ctor(CShells.ShellSettings)\">\n            <summary>Composes profile-independent authentication and permission services into a shell.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.FoundationAuthenticationFeature.ConfigureServices(Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection.IServiceCollection)\">\n            <inheritdoc />\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"T:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.FoundationWebOptions\">\n            <summary>Defines settings shared by the Orbyss Foundation authentication profile features.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"F:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.FoundationWebOptions.SectionName\">\n            <summary>Gets the shell-configuration section containing secure web settings.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.FoundationWebOptions.Authority\">\n            <summary>Gets or sets the OIDC issuer authority.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.FoundationWebOptions.BackchannelAuthority\">\n            <summary>\n            Gets or sets an optional server-reachable authority used only to retrieve OIDC metadata.\n            The public <see cref=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.FoundationWebOptions.Authority\"/> remains the issuer and browser-facing authority.\n            </summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.FoundationWebOptions.ClientId\">\n            <summary>Gets or sets the registered OAuth client identifier.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.FoundationWebOptions.ClientSecret\">\n            <summary>Gets or sets the confidential BFF client secret.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.FoundationWebOptions.Audience\">\n            <summary>Gets or sets the protected API audience.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.FoundationWebOptions.Scopes\">\n            <summary>Gets or sets the scopes requested during interactive authentication. Explicit shell configuration replaces these fallback defaults.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.FoundationWebOptions.RoleClaim\">\n            <summary>Gets or sets the provider claim containing normalized application roles.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.FoundationWebOptions.PermissionClaim\">\n            <summary>Gets or sets the canonical claim containing application permission identities.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.FoundationWebOptions.RolePermissions\">\n            <summary>Gets provider-role to canonical application-permission mappings.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.FoundationWebOptions.ScopePermissions\">\n            <summary>Gets provider-scope to canonical application-permission mappings.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.FoundationWebOptions.AllowedOrigins\">\n            <summary>Gets or sets the exact origins permitted by the direct SPA profile.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.FoundationWebOptions.CallbackPath\">\n            <summary>Gets or sets the local OIDC authorization callback path.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.FoundationWebOptions.SignedOutCallbackPath\">\n            <summary>Gets or sets the local callback path used after provider logout.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.FoundationWebOptions.RemoteSignOutPath\">\n            <summary>Gets or sets the path receiving provider-initiated logout notifications.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.FoundationWebOptions.AccessDeniedPath\">\n            <summary>Gets or sets the interactive access-denied path.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.FoundationWebOptions.CookieName\">\n            <summary>Gets or sets the host-only encrypted session cookie name.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.FoundationWebOptions.DiscoveryTimeoutSeconds\">\n            <summary>Gets or sets the discovery and JWKS readiness budget in seconds.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.FoundationWebOptions.RemoteAuthenticationTimeoutSeconds\">\n            <summary>Gets or sets the maximum duration of an interactive remote authentication operation.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.FoundationWebOptions.SessionIdleMinutes\">\n            <summary>Gets or sets the sliding server session idle lifetime in minutes.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.FoundationWebOptions.SessionAbsoluteMinutes\">\n            <summary>Gets or sets the non-extendable server session lifetime in minutes.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.FoundationWebOptions.AllowHttpForLocalDevelopment\">\n            <summary>Gets or sets whether loopback/container HTTP is accepted during local development.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"T:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.FoundationWebOptionsValidator\">\n            <summary>Rejects incomplete common authentication settings and ambiguous profile activation.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.FoundationWebOptionsValidator.#ctor(Microsoft.Extensions.Hosting.IHostEnvironment,System.Collections.Generic.IEnumerable{Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.IFoundationAuthenticationProfile})\">\n            <summary>Rejects incomplete common authentication settings and ambiguous profile activation.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.FoundationWebOptionsValidator.Validate(System.String,Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.FoundationWebOptions)\">\n            <inheritdoc />\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.FoundationWebOptionsValidator.Require(System.String,System.String,System.Collections.Generic.ICollection{System.String})\">\n            <summary>Adds a required-value failure for an empty setting.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.FoundationWebOptionsValidator.IsReserved(System.String)\">\n            <summary>Protects projection ownership from deployment claim mappings.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.FoundationWebOptionsValidator.ValidatePermissionMappings(System.Collections.Generic.IReadOnlyDictionary{System.String,System.String[]},System.String,System.Collections.Generic.ICollection{System.String})\">\n            <summary>Rejects empty provider keys and permission identities.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"T:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.IAuthenticationErrorWriter\">\n            <summary>Writes an authentication-boundary error response.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.IAuthenticationErrorWriter.WriteAsync(Microsoft.AspNetCore.Http.HttpContext,System.Int32,System.String)\">\n            <summary>Writes the response using the consumer-selected representation.</summary>\n            <param name=\"context\">The current HTTP context.</param>\n            <param name=\"statusCode\">The HTTP status code.</param>\n            <param name=\"code\">The stable authentication error code.</param>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"T:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.IFoundationAuthenticationProfile\">\n            <summary>Identifies one concrete Orbyss Foundation authentication profile in a shell.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.IFoundationAuthenticationProfile.Name\">\n            <summary>Gets the stable profile identity.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"T:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.IValidatedAccountIdentityReader\">\n            <summary>Admits one authenticated principal into the validated account projection contract.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.IValidatedAccountIdentityReader.TryRead(System.Security.Claims.ClaimsPrincipal,Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.Core.ValidatedAccountIdentity@)\">\n            <summary>Requires exactly one identity and one nonempty reserved issuer-subject claim pair.</summary>\n            <param name=\"principal\">The principal produced by the selected authentication handler.</param>\n            <param name=\"identity\">The admitted account projection, or null on rejection.</param>\n            <returns>Whether the principal has an unambiguous authenticated projection.</returns>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"T:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.PermissionClaimsTransformation\">\n            <summary>Maps provider roles and scopes to deployment-owned canonical application permissions.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.PermissionClaimsTransformation.#ctor(Microsoft.Extensions.Options.IOptions{Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.FoundationWebOptions})\">\n            <summary>Maps provider roles and scopes to deployment-owned canonical application permissions.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.PermissionClaimsTransformation.TransformAsync(System.Security.Claims.ClaimsPrincipal)\">\n            <inheritdoc />\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.PermissionClaimsTransformation.AddMappedPermissions(System.Collections.Generic.IEnumerable{System.String},System.Collections.Generic.IReadOnlyDictionary{System.String,System.String[]},System.Collections.Generic.ISet{System.String})\">\n            <summary>Adds exact configured permission mappings without wildcard expansion.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"T:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.PermissionPolicyProvider\">\n            <summary>Builds authorization policies from stable <c>permission:name</c> identifiers.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.PermissionPolicyProvider.#ctor(Microsoft.Extensions.Options.IOptions{Microsoft.AspNetCore.Authorization.AuthorizationOptions},Microsoft.Extensions.Options.IOptions{Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.FoundationWebOptions})\">\n            <summary>Builds authorization policies from stable <c>permission:name</c> identifiers.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"F:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.PermissionPolicyProvider.Prefix\">\n            <summary>Prefixes canonical application-permission policies.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.PermissionPolicyProvider.GetPolicyAsync(System.String)\">\n            <inheritdoc />\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"T:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ValidatedAccountIdentityReader\">\n            <summary>Reads only unambiguous projections; it never chooses a first identity or first claim.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ValidatedAccountIdentityReader.TryRead(System.Security.Claims.ClaimsPrincipal,Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.Core.ValidatedAccountIdentity@)\">\n            <inheritdoc />\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ValidatedAccountIdentityReader.SingleValue(System.Security.Claims.ClaimsIdentity,System.String)\">\n            <summary>Rejects absent, duplicate and empty reserved values.</summary>\n        </member>\n    </members>\n</doc>\n",
    "orbyss-foundation/feature.json": "{\n  \"schemaVersion\": 2,\n  \"packageId\": \"Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication\",\n  \"features\": [\n    {\n      \"identity\": \"Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication\",\n      \"featureDependencies\": [],\n      \"runtimeDependencies\": [],\n      \"routes\": [],\n      \"dormant\": true,\n      \"composeForOpenApi\": false,\n      \"requiresContractCoverage\": false\n    }\n  ],\n  \"sourceSha256\": {\n    \"DefaultAuthenticationErrorWriter.cs\": \"9d4446c89d6889bb5040f875c0ba17ade1a9b4d020bc3927259f6855093b38cd\",\n    \"FoundationAuthenticationFeature.cs\": \"f0f062b346b50030e9865a5e7518bdf2aadd9135a43aaf2279e732b85f955592\",\n    \"FoundationWebOptions.cs\": \"d5cea8dde1008f58c300b02037447322332a5582303d34ddf4ce8f01fb51fa07\",\n    \"FoundationWebOptionsValidator.cs\": \"c28ed0bc9751ae2c4ad8a1eee2bc9bb01901dc858a9b6b2f818d80a1d6c54e9c\",\n    \"IAuthenticationErrorWriter.cs\": \"d965483f0a1c5c817a0fc3415fc93d93e7bad83b32177750d840f143b9584b6a\",\n    \"IFoundationAuthenticationProfile.cs\": \"b365e3944d9e1065953cbc32d66032d9895db65d38097f700d6dd3dd94eceedc\",\n    \"IValidatedAccountIdentityReader.cs\": \"3f550b0b5f7fe7f9a333d6ab01c7a9d46a09a56d778532f89c6715ee4c42ff46\",\n    \"PermissionClaimsTransformation.cs\": \"a087697b47b4d59ada7ebe1442930232867d23671ebe58eafb2cae83aaa0c837\",\n    \"PermissionPolicyProvider.cs\": \"25221ec37fc4d9e2aaf4bbdb28cc736fd0392a3bbb37e528b1c7142335a9f07a\",\n    \"ValidatedAccountIdentityReader.cs\": \"58a2c474b99d30963c9e040868455e7347e654d7aff0428c8a61e7bc0e00c4e8\"\n  },\n  \"hostProvidedDependencies\": [\n    {\n      \"packageId\": \"CShells.Abstractions\",\n      \"minimumVersion\": \"0.0.30-preview.159\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"packageId\": \"JetBrains.Annotations\",\n      \"minimumVersion\": \"2025.2.4\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n",
    "orbyss-foundation/settings.json": "{\n  \"schemaVersion\": 2,\n  \"packageId\": \"Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication\",\n  \"packageVersion\": \"0.3.1\",\n  \"sourceSha256\": {\n    \"DefaultAuthenticationErrorWriter.cs\": \"9d4446c89d6889bb5040f875c0ba17ade1a9b4d020bc3927259f6855093b38cd\",\n    \"FoundationAuthenticationFeature.cs\": \"f0f062b346b50030e9865a5e7518bdf2aadd9135a43aaf2279e732b85f955592\",\n    \"FoundationWebOptions.cs\": \"d5cea8dde1008f58c300b02037447322332a5582303d34ddf4ce8f01fb51fa07\",\n    \"FoundationWebOptionsValidator.cs\": \"c28ed0bc9751ae2c4ad8a1eee2bc9bb01901dc858a9b6b2f818d80a1d6c54e9c\",\n    \"IAuthenticationErrorWriter.cs\": \"d965483f0a1c5c817a0fc3415fc93d93e7bad83b32177750d840f143b9584b6a\",\n    \"IFoundationAuthenticationProfile.cs\": \"b365e3944d9e1065953cbc32d66032d9895db65d38097f700d6dd3dd94eceedc\",\n    \"IValidatedAccountIdentityReader.cs\": \"3f550b0b5f7fe7f9a333d6ab01c7a9d46a09a56d778532f89c6715ee4c42ff46\",\n    \"PermissionClaimsTransformation.cs\": \"a087697b47b4d59ada7ebe1442930232867d23671ebe58eafb2cae83aaa0c837\",\n    \"PermissionPolicyProvider.cs\": \"25221ec37fc4d9e2aaf4bbdb28cc736fd0392a3bbb37e528b1c7142335a9f07a\",\n    \"ValidatedAccountIdentityReader.cs\": \"58a2c474b99d30963c9e040868455e7347e654d7aff0428c8a61e7bc0e00c4e8\"\n  },\n  \"contracts\": [\n    {\n      \"schemaVersion\": 2,\n      \"owner\": \"Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication\",\n      \"scope\": \"web\",\n      \"complete\": true,\n      \"sources\": {\n        \"DefaultAuthenticationErrorWriter.cs\": \"9d4446c89d6889bb5040f875c0ba17ade1a9b4d020bc3927259f6855093b38cd\",\n        \"FoundationAuthenticationFeature.cs\": \"f0f062b346b50030e9865a5e7518bdf2aadd9135a43aaf2279e732b85f955592\",\n        \"FoundationWebOptions.cs\": \"d5cea8dde1008f58c300b02037447322332a5582303d34ddf4ce8f01fb51fa07\",\n        \"FoundationWebOptionsValidator.cs\": \"c28ed0bc9751ae2c4ad8a1eee2bc9bb01901dc858a9b6b2f818d80a1d6c54e9c\",\n        \"IAuthenticationErrorWriter.cs\": \"d965483f0a1c5c817a0fc3415fc93d93e7bad83b32177750d840f143b9584b6a\",\n        \"IFoundationAuthenticationProfile.cs\": \"b365e3944d9e1065953cbc32d66032d9895db65d38097f700d6dd3dd94eceedc\",\n        \"IValidatedAccountIdentityReader.cs\": \"3f550b0b5f7fe7f9a333d6ab01c7a9d46a09a56d778532f89c6715ee4c42ff46\",\n        \"PermissionClaimsTransformation.cs\": \"a087697b47b4d59ada7ebe1442930232867d23671ebe58eafb2cae83aaa0c837\",\n        \"PermissionPolicyProvider.cs\": \"25221ec37fc4d9e2aaf4bbdb28cc736fd0392a3bbb37e528b1c7142335a9f07a\",\n        \"ValidatedAccountIdentityReader.cs\": \"58a2c474b99d30963c9e040868455e7347e654d7aff0428c8a61e7bc0e00c4e8\"\n      },\n      \"settings\": [\n        {\n          \"path\": \"Foundation:Web:Authority\",\n          \"required\": true,\n          \"secret\": false,\n          \"constraints\": {\n            \"format\": \"uri\"\n          },\n          \"binding\": \"The selected shell feature binds this section from ShellSettings.GetConfigurationRoot using the native .NET configuration binder. Options are consumed within that shell provider generation; recompose/restart the shell to replace cached options.\",\n          \"precedence\": [\n            \"typed property initializer\",\n            \"named shell Configuration snapshot\",\n            \"feature settings overlay in native shell composition\",\n            \"explicit registered options configuration in registration order\"\n          ],\n          \"reload\": \"restart\",\n          \"description\": \"Gets or sets the OIDC issuer authority.\",\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"default\": \"\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"Foundation:Web:BackchannelAuthority\",\n          \"required\": false,\n          \"secret\": false,\n          \"constraints\": {},\n          \"binding\": \"The selected shell feature binds this section from ShellSettings.GetConfigurationRoot using the native .NET configuration binder. Options are consumed within that shell provider generation; recompose/restart the shell to replace cached options.\",\n          \"precedence\": [\n            \"typed property initializer\",\n            \"named shell Configuration snapshot\",\n            \"feature settings overlay in native shell composition\",\n            \"explicit registered options configuration in registration order\"\n          ],\n          \"reload\": \"restart\",\n          \"description\": \"BackchannelAuthority\",\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"default\": \"\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"Foundation:Web:ClientId\",\n          \"required\": true,\n          \"secret\": false,\n          \"constraints\": {\n            \"minLength\": 1\n          },\n          \"binding\": \"The selected shell feature binds this section from ShellSettings.GetConfigurationRoot using the native .NET configuration binder. Options are consumed within that shell provider generation; recompose/restart the shell to replace cached options.\",\n          \"precedence\": [\n            \"typed property initializer\",\n            \"named shell Configuration snapshot\",\n            \"feature settings overlay in native shell composition\",\n            \"explicit registered options configuration in registration order\"\n          ],\n          \"reload\": \"restart\",\n          \"description\": \"Gets or sets the registered OAuth client identifier.\",\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"default\": \"\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"Foundation:Web:ClientSecret\",\n          \"required\": false,\n          \"secret\": true,\n          \"constraints\": {},\n          \"binding\": \"The selected shell feature binds this section from ShellSettings.GetConfigurationRoot using the native .NET configuration binder. Options are consumed within that shell provider generation; recompose/restart the shell to replace cached options.\",\n          \"precedence\": [\n            \"typed property initializer\",\n            \"named shell Configuration snapshot\",\n            \"feature settings overlay in native shell composition\",\n            \"explicit registered options configuration in registration order\"\n          ],\n          \"reload\": \"restart\",\n          \"description\": \"Gets or sets the confidential BFF client secret.\",\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"Foundation:Web:Audience\",\n          \"required\": true,\n          \"secret\": false,\n          \"constraints\": {\n            \"minLength\": 1\n          },\n          \"binding\": \"The selected shell feature binds this section from ShellSettings.GetConfigurationRoot using the native .NET configuration binder. Options are consumed within that shell provider generation; recompose/restart the shell to replace cached options.\",\n          \"precedence\": [\n            \"typed property initializer\",\n            \"named shell Configuration snapshot\",\n            \"feature settings overlay in native shell composition\",\n            \"explicit registered options configuration in registration order\"\n          ],\n          \"reload\": \"restart\",\n          \"description\": \"Gets or sets the protected API audience.\",\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"default\": \"\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"Foundation:Web:Scopes\",\n          \"required\": true,\n          \"secret\": false,\n          \"constraints\": {\n            \"minItems\": 1,\n            \"uniqueItems\": true,\n            \"items\": {\n              \"type\": \"string\",\n              \"pattern\": \"^[\\\\x21\\\\x23-\\\\x5B\\\\x5D-\\\\x7E]\\u002B$\"\n            }\n          },\n          \"binding\": \"The selected shell feature binds this section from ShellSettings.GetConfigurationRoot using the native .NET configuration binder. Options are consumed within that shell provider generation; recompose/restart the shell to replace cached options.\",\n          \"precedence\": [\n            \"typed property initializer\",\n            \"named shell Configuration snapshot\",\n            \"feature settings overlay in native shell composition\",\n            \"explicit registered options configuration in registration order\"\n          ],\n          \"reload\": \"restart\",\n          \"description\": \"Gets or sets the scopes requested during interactive authentication. Explicit shell configuration replaces these fallback defaults.\",\n          \"type\": \"array\",\n          \"default\": [\n            \"openid\",\n            \"profile\",\n            \"offline_access\",\n            \"orbyss-foundation-api\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"Foundation:Web:RoleClaim\",\n          \"required\": true,\n          \"secret\": false,\n          \"constraints\": {\n            \"minLength\": 1\n          },\n          \"binding\": \"The selected shell feature binds this section from ShellSettings.GetConfigurationRoot using the native .NET configuration binder. Options are consumed within that shell provider generation; recompose/restart the shell to replace cached options.\",\n          \"precedence\": [\n            \"typed property initializer\",\n            \"named shell Configuration snapshot\",\n            \"feature settings overlay in native shell composition\",\n            \"explicit registered options configuration in registration order\"\n          ],\n          \"reload\": \"restart\",\n          \"description\": \"Gets or sets the provider claim containing normalized application roles.\",\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"default\": \"roles\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"Foundation:Web:PermissionClaim\",\n          \"required\": true,\n          \"secret\": false,\n          \"constraints\": {\n            \"minLength\": 1\n          },\n          \"binding\": \"The selected shell feature binds this section from ShellSettings.GetConfigurationRoot using the native .NET configuration binder. Options are consumed within that shell provider generation; recompose/restart the shell to replace cached options.\",\n          \"precedence\": [\n            \"typed property initializer\",\n            \"named shell Configuration snapshot\",\n            \"feature settings overlay in native shell composition\",\n            \"explicit registered options configuration in registration order\"\n          ],\n          \"reload\": \"restart\",\n          \"description\": \"Gets or sets the canonical claim containing application permission identities.\",\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"default\": \"permissions\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"Foundation:Web:RolePermissions\",\n          \"required\": false,\n          \"secret\": false,\n          \"constraints\": {\n            \"additionalProperties\": {\n              \"type\": \"array\",\n              \"minItems\": 1,\n              \"items\": {\n                \"type\": \"string\",\n                \"minLength\": 1\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          \"binding\": \"The selected shell feature binds this section from ShellSettings.GetConfigurationRoot using the native .NET configuration binder. Options are consumed within that shell provider generation; recompose/restart the shell to replace cached options.\",\n          \"precedence\": [\n            \"typed property initializer\",\n            \"named shell Configuration snapshot\",\n            \"feature settings overlay in native shell composition\",\n            \"explicit registered options configuration in registration order\"\n          ],\n          \"reload\": \"restart\",\n          \"description\": \"Gets provider-role to canonical application-permission mappings.\",\n          \"type\": \"object\",\n          \"default\": {}\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"Foundation:Web:ScopePermissions\",\n          \"required\": false,\n          \"secret\": false,\n          \"constraints\": {\n            \"additionalProperties\": {\n              \"type\": \"array\",\n              \"minItems\": 1,\n              \"items\": {\n                \"type\": \"string\",\n                \"minLength\": 1\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          \"binding\": \"The selected shell feature binds this section from ShellSettings.GetConfigurationRoot using the native .NET configuration binder. Options are consumed within that shell provider generation; recompose/restart the shell to replace cached options.\",\n          \"precedence\": [\n            \"typed property initializer\",\n            \"named shell Configuration snapshot\",\n            \"feature settings overlay in native shell composition\",\n            \"explicit registered options configuration in registration order\"\n          ],\n          \"reload\": \"restart\",\n          \"description\": \"Gets provider-scope to canonical application-permission mappings.\",\n          \"type\": \"object\",\n          \"default\": {}\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"Foundation:Web:AllowedOrigins\",\n          \"required\": false,\n          \"secret\": false,\n          \"constraints\": {},\n          \"binding\": \"The selected shell feature binds this section from ShellSettings.GetConfigurationRoot using the native .NET configuration binder. Options are consumed within that shell provider generation; recompose/restart the shell to replace cached options.\",\n          \"precedence\": [\n            \"typed property initializer\",\n            \"named shell Configuration snapshot\",\n            \"feature settings overlay in native shell composition\",\n            \"explicit registered options configuration in registration order\"\n          ],\n          \"reload\": \"restart\",\n          \"description\": \"Gets or sets the exact origins permitted by the direct SPA profile.\",\n          \"type\": \"array\",\n          \"default\": []\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"Foundation:Web:CallbackPath\",\n          \"required\": false,\n          \"secret\": false,\n          \"constraints\": {},\n          \"binding\": \"The selected shell feature binds this section from ShellSettings.GetConfigurationRoot using the native .NET configuration binder. Options are consumed within that shell provider generation; recompose/restart the shell to replace cached options.\",\n          \"precedence\": [\n            \"typed property initializer\",\n            \"named shell Configuration snapshot\",\n            \"feature settings overlay in native shell composition\",\n            \"explicit registered options configuration in registration order\"\n          ],\n          \"reload\": \"restart\",\n          \"description\": \"Gets or sets the local OIDC authorization callback path.\",\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"default\": \"/signin-oidc\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"Foundation:Web:SignedOutCallbackPath\",\n          \"required\": false,\n          \"secret\": false,\n          \"constraints\": {},\n          \"binding\": \"The selected shell feature binds this section from ShellSettings.GetConfigurationRoot using the native .NET configuration binder. Options are consumed within that shell provider generation; recompose/restart the shell to replace cached options.\",\n          \"precedence\": [\n            \"typed property initializer\",\n            \"named shell Configuration snapshot\",\n            \"feature settings overlay in native shell composition\",\n            \"explicit registered options configuration in registration order\"\n          ],\n          \"reload\": \"restart\",\n          \"description\": \"Gets or sets the local callback path used after provider logout.\",\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"default\": \"/signout-callback-oidc\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"Foundation:Web:RemoteSignOutPath\",\n          \"required\": false,\n          \"secret\": false,\n          \"constraints\": {},\n          \"binding\": \"The selected shell feature binds this section from ShellSettings.GetConfigurationRoot using the native .NET configuration binder. Options are consumed within that shell provider generation; recompose/restart the shell to replace cached options.\",\n          \"precedence\": [\n            \"typed property initializer\",\n            \"named shell Configuration snapshot\",\n            \"feature settings overlay in native shell composition\",\n            \"explicit registered options configuration in registration order\"\n          ],\n          \"reload\": \"restart\",\n          \"description\": \"Gets or sets the path receiving provider-initiated logout notifications.\",\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"default\": \"/signout-oidc\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"Foundation:Web:AccessDeniedPath\",\n          \"required\": false,\n          \"secret\": false,\n          \"constraints\": {},\n          \"binding\": \"The selected shell feature binds this section from ShellSettings.GetConfigurationRoot using the native .NET configuration binder. Options are consumed within that shell provider generation; recompose/restart the shell to replace cached options.\",\n          \"precedence\": [\n            \"typed property initializer\",\n            \"named shell Configuration snapshot\",\n            \"feature settings overlay in native shell composition\",\n            \"explicit registered options configuration in registration order\"\n          ],\n          \"reload\": \"restart\",\n          \"description\": \"Gets or sets the interactive access-denied path.\",\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"default\": \"/bff/access-denied\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"Foundation:Web:CookieName\",\n          \"required\": false,\n          \"secret\": false,\n          \"constraints\": {},\n          \"binding\": \"The selected shell feature binds this section from ShellSettings.GetConfigurationRoot using the native .NET configuration binder. Options are consumed within that shell provider generation; recompose/restart the shell to replace cached options.\",\n          \"precedence\": [\n            \"typed property initializer\",\n            \"named shell Configuration snapshot\",\n            \"feature settings overlay in native shell composition\",\n            \"explicit registered options configuration in registration order\"\n          ],\n          \"reload\": \"restart\",\n          \"description\": \"Gets or sets the host-only encrypted session cookie name.\",\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"default\": \"__Host-orbyss-foundation-session\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"Foundation:Web:DiscoveryTimeoutSeconds\",\n          \"required\": false,\n          \"secret\": false,\n          \"constraints\": {\n            \"minimum\": 1,\n            \"maximum\": 30\n          },\n          \"binding\": \"The selected shell feature binds this section from ShellSettings.GetConfigurationRoot using the native .NET configuration binder. Options are consumed within that shell provider generation; recompose/restart the shell to replace cached options.\",\n          \"precedence\": [\n            \"typed property initializer\",\n            \"named shell Configuration snapshot\",\n            \"feature settings overlay in native shell composition\",\n            \"explicit registered options configuration in registration order\"\n          ],\n          \"reload\": \"restart\",\n          \"description\": \"Gets or sets the discovery and JWKS readiness budget in seconds.\",\n          \"type\": \"integer\",\n          \"default\": 3\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"Foundation:Web:RemoteAuthenticationTimeoutSeconds\",\n          \"required\": false,\n          \"secret\": false,\n          \"constraints\": {},\n          \"binding\": \"The selected shell feature binds this section from ShellSettings.GetConfigurationRoot using the native .NET configuration binder. Options are consumed within that shell provider generation; recompose/restart the shell to replace cached options.\",\n          \"precedence\": [\n            \"typed property initializer\",\n            \"named shell Configuration snapshot\",\n            \"feature settings overlay in native shell composition\",\n            \"explicit registered options configuration in registration order\"\n          ],\n          \"reload\": \"restart\",\n          \"description\": \"Gets or sets the maximum duration of an interactive remote authentication operation.\",\n          \"type\": \"integer\",\n          \"default\": 10\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"Foundation:Web:SessionIdleMinutes\",\n          \"required\": false,\n          \"secret\": false,\n          \"constraints\": {\n            \"minimum\": 1\n          },\n          \"binding\": \"The selected shell feature binds this section from ShellSettings.GetConfigurationRoot using the native .NET configuration binder. Options are consumed within that shell provider generation; recompose/restart the shell to replace cached options.\",\n          \"precedence\": [\n            \"typed property initializer\",\n            \"named shell Configuration snapshot\",\n            \"feature settings overlay in native shell composition\",\n            \"explicit registered options configuration in registration order\"\n          ],\n          \"reload\": \"restart\",\n          \"description\": \"Gets or sets the sliding server session idle lifetime in minutes.\",\n          \"type\": \"integer\",\n          \"default\": 30\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"Foundation:Web:SessionAbsoluteMinutes\",\n          \"required\": false,\n          \"secret\": false,\n          \"constraints\": {\n            \"minimum\": 1\n          },\n          \"binding\": \"The selected shell feature binds this section from ShellSettings.GetConfigurationRoot using the native .NET configuration binder. Options are consumed within that shell provider generation; recompose/restart the shell to replace cached options.\",\n          \"precedence\": [\n            \"typed property initializer\",\n            \"named shell Configuration snapshot\",\n            \"feature settings overlay in native shell composition\",\n            \"explicit registered options configuration in registration order\"\n          ],\n          \"reload\": \"restart\",\n          \"description\": \"Gets or sets the non-extendable server session lifetime in minutes.\",\n          \"type\": \"integer\",\n          \"default\": 480\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"Foundation:Web:AllowHttpForLocalDevelopment\",\n          \"required\": false,\n          \"secret\": false,\n          \"constraints\": {},\n          \"binding\": \"The selected shell feature binds this section from ShellSettings.GetConfigurationRoot using the native .NET configuration binder. Options are consumed within that shell provider generation; recompose/restart the shell to replace cached options.\",\n          \"precedence\": [\n            \"typed property initializer\",\n            \"named shell Configuration snapshot\",\n            \"feature settings overlay in native shell composition\",\n            \"explicit registered options configuration in registration order\"\n          ],\n          \"reload\": \"restart\",\n          \"description\": \"Gets or sets whether loopback/container HTTP is accepted during local development.\",\n          \"type\": \"boolean\",\n          \"default\": false\n        }\n      ],\n      \"semanticConstraints\": [\n        \"Exactly one distinct authentication profile must be active in this shell.\",\n        \"Authority must be absolute HTTPS; loopback HTTP is accepted only in Development with AllowHttpForLocalDevelopment.\",\n        \"Nonempty BackchannelAuthority must be absolute HTTPS without query/fragment; Development plus AllowHttpForLocalDevelopment also permits HTTP for container backchannels.\",\n        \"Explicit Scopes configuration must be a nonempty consecutively indexed scalar array including openid. The feature clears typed fallback scopes before native binding of that explicit selection; absent Scopes retains typed defaults.\",\n        \"RoleClaim and PermissionClaim must not use either reserved validated issuer/subject projection name, ignoring case.\",\n        \"Permission mappings require nonempty provider keys and nonempty permission arrays with nonblank items; dictionary keys are ordinal.\",\n        \"SessionAbsoluteMinutes must not be shorter than SessionIdleMinutes.\",\n        \"BFF-cookie and SPA-PKCE add independently owned profile validation; their metadata must accompany the selected profile.\",\n        \"Export describes supported inputs; it does not contact discovery/identity services or expose configured secrets.\"\n      ],\n      \"appliesTo\": {\n        \"kind\": \"shell\",\n        \"features\": [\n          \"Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication\"\n        ],\n        \"configuration\": [\n          \"Foundation:Web:Authority\",\n          \"Foundation:Web:BackchannelAuthority\",\n          \"Foundation:Web:ClientId\",\n          \"Foundation:Web:ClientSecret\",\n          \"Foundation:Web:Audience\",\n          \"Foundation:Web:Scopes\",\n          \"Foundation:Web:RoleClaim\",\n          \"Foundation:Web:PermissionClaim\",\n          \"Foundation:Web:RolePermissions\",\n          \"Foundation:Web:ScopePermissions\",\n          \"Foundation:Web:AllowedOrigins\",\n          \"Foundation:Web:CallbackPath\",\n          \"Foundation:Web:SignedOutCallbackPath\",\n          \"Foundation:Web:RemoteSignOutPath\",\n          \"Foundation:Web:AccessDeniedPath\",\n          \"Foundation:Web:CookieName\",\n          \"Foundation:Web:DiscoveryTimeoutSeconds\",\n          \"Foundation:Web:RemoteAuthenticationTimeoutSeconds\",\n          \"Foundation:Web:SessionIdleMinutes\",\n          \"Foundation:Web:SessionAbsoluteMinutes\",\n          \"Foundation:Web:AllowHttpForLocalDevelopment\"\n        ]\n      },\n      \"typeName\": \"Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.FoundationWebOptions\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"assembly\": {\n    \"name\": \"Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.dll\",\n    \"sha256\": \"9f0a93c7569adc50c29ba6b15fc8781bb6c71f230777e6d1949d5be1cafadc65\"\n  },\n  \"imports\": []\n}\n"
  }
