  "facts": {
    "README.md": "# Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials\n\nProvider-neutral OAuth 2.0 client-credentials acquisition packaged as a CShells feature. Configure\none or more named token-endpoint registrations under\n`Foundation:Authentication:ClientCredentials:Registrations`. The feature validates every endpoint,\nclient authentication method, scope, and lifetime setting when its shell activates; caches tokens\nper registration; and coalesces concurrent refreshes without logging credentials or token bodies.\n\nIdentity-provider adapters generate these portable settings. Application features depend on\n`IClientCredentialsTokenProvider` and a registration name, never on an identity-provider SDK,\nrealm, tenant, or admin API.\n",
    "lib/net10.0/Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials.xml": "<?xml version=\"1.0\"?>\n<doc>\n    <assembly>\n        <name>Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials</name>\n    </assembly>\n    <members>\n        <member name=\"T:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials.ClientCredentialsOptions\">\n            <summary>Defines named provider-neutral OAuth client-credentials registrations.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"F:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials.ClientCredentialsOptions.SectionName\">\n            <summary>Gets the configuration section containing client-credentials registrations.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials.ClientCredentialsOptions.Registrations\">\n            <summary>Gets registrations keyed by the application-owned token-source name.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"T:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials.ClientCredentialsOptionsValidator\">\n            <summary>Rejects incomplete or unsafe OAuth client-credentials registrations.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials.ClientCredentialsOptionsValidator.#ctor(Microsoft.Extensions.Hosting.IHostEnvironment)\">\n            <summary>Rejects incomplete or unsafe OAuth client-credentials registrations.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials.ClientCredentialsOptionsValidator.Validate(System.String,Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials.ClientCredentialsOptions)\">\n            <inheritdoc />\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials.ClientCredentialsOptionsValidator.ValidateEndpoint(System.String,System.Boolean,System.String,System.Collections.Generic.ICollection{System.String})\">\n            <summary>Validates transport and URI constraints for one token endpoint.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials.ClientCredentialsOptionsValidator.Require(System.String,System.String,System.Collections.Generic.ICollection{System.String})\">\n            <summary>Adds a path-specific validation failure for a missing value.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"T:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials.ClientCredentialsRegistration\">\n            <summary>Configures one OAuth client-credentials token source.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials.ClientCredentialsRegistration.TokenEndpoint\">\n            <summary>Gets or sets the absolute OAuth token endpoint.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials.ClientCredentialsRegistration.ClientId\">\n            <summary>Gets or sets the OAuth client identifier.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials.ClientCredentialsRegistration.ClientSecret\">\n            <summary>Gets or sets the OAuth client secret supplied by a deployment secret provider.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials.ClientCredentialsRegistration.ClientAuthenticationMethod\">\n            <summary>Gets or sets `client_secret_basic` or `client_secret_post`.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials.ClientCredentialsRegistration.Scopes\">\n            <summary>Gets or sets the exact scopes requested for the machine identity.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials.ClientCredentialsRegistration.RefreshBeforeExpirySeconds\">\n            <summary>Gets or sets how early a cached token is refreshed, in seconds.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials.ClientCredentialsRegistration.TimeoutSeconds\">\n            <summary>Gets or sets the token-endpoint request timeout, in seconds.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials.ClientCredentialsRegistration.AllowHttpForLocalDevelopment\">\n            <summary>Gets or sets whether loopback HTTP is accepted during local development.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"T:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials.ClientCredentialsTokenProvider\">\n            <summary>Acquires and caches named OAuth client-credentials tokens.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials.ClientCredentialsTokenProvider.#ctor(System.Net.Http.IHttpClientFactory,Microsoft.Extensions.Options.IOptions{Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials.ClientCredentialsOptions},System.TimeProvider)\">\n            <summary>Acquires and caches named OAuth client-credentials tokens.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"F:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials.ClientCredentialsTokenProvider.HttpClientName\">\n            <summary>Names the isolated HTTP client used for token-endpoint traffic.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"F:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials.ClientCredentialsTokenProvider.cache\">\n            <summary>Holds the most recent bounded token for each registration.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"F:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials.ClientCredentialsTokenProvider.locks\">\n            <summary>Coalesces concurrent refreshes independently for each registration.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials.ClientCredentialsTokenProvider.GetTokenAsync(System.String,System.Threading.CancellationToken)\">\n            <inheritdoc />\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials.ClientCredentialsTokenProvider.Dispose\">\n            <inheritdoc />\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials.ClientCredentialsTokenProvider.GetRegistration(System.String)\">\n            <summary>Resolves an exact configured registration or fails without fallback.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials.ClientCredentialsTokenProvider.TryGetUsableToken(System.String,Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials.ClientCredentialsRegistration,Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials.OAuthAccessToken@)\">\n            <summary>Returns a cached token only while it remains outside its refresh window.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials.ClientCredentialsTokenProvider.AcquireAsync(Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials.ClientCredentialsRegistration,System.Threading.CancellationToken)\">\n            <summary>Performs one bounded OAuth client-credentials request.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials.ClientCredentialsTokenProvider.RequiredString(System.Text.Json.JsonElement,System.String)\">\n            <summary>Reads one required non-empty string from a successful token response.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials.ClientCredentialsTokenProvider.ReadExpiresIn(System.Text.Json.JsonElement)\">\n            <summary>Reads the positive OAuth expires-in lifetime in its interoperable number or string form.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials.ClientCredentialsTokenProvider.FormEncode(System.String)\">\n            <summary>Encodes a client credential for the OAuth HTTP Basic convention.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"T:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials.FoundationClientCredentialsFeature\">\n            <summary>Composes provider-neutral machine-token acquisition into one shell.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials.FoundationClientCredentialsFeature.#ctor(CShells.ShellSettings)\">\n            <summary>Composes provider-neutral machine-token acquisition into one shell.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials.FoundationClientCredentialsFeature.ConfigureServices(Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection.IServiceCollection)\">\n            <inheritdoc />\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"T:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials.IClientCredentialsTokenProvider\">\n            <summary>Acquires cached tokens for named OAuth client-credentials registrations.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials.IClientCredentialsTokenProvider.GetTokenAsync(System.String,System.Threading.CancellationToken)\">\n            <summary>Gets a usable access token for the named machine identity.</summary>\n            <param name=\"registration\">The exact configured registration name.</param>\n            <param name=\"cancellationToken\">Cancels token-endpoint I/O.</param>\n            <returns>A usable access token with its local expiry bound.</returns>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"T:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials.OAuthAccessToken\">\n            <summary>Represents an OAuth access token and its bounded local expiry.</summary>\n            <param name=\"Value\">The opaque access-token value.</param>\n            <param name=\"TokenType\">The token type returned by the authorization server.</param>\n            <param name=\"ExpiresAt\">The absolute time after which the token must not be used.</param>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials.OAuthAccessToken.#ctor(System.String,System.String,System.DateTimeOffset)\">\n            <summary>Represents an OAuth access token and its bounded local expiry.</summary>\n            <param name=\"Value\">The opaque access-token value.</param>\n            <param name=\"TokenType\">The token type returned by the authorization server.</param>\n            <param name=\"ExpiresAt\">The absolute time after which the token must not be used.</param>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials.OAuthAccessToken.Value\">\n            <summary>The opaque access-token value.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials.OAuthAccessToken.TokenType\">\n            <summary>The token type returned by the authorization server.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials.OAuthAccessToken.ExpiresAt\">\n            <summary>The absolute time after which the token must not be used.</summary>\n        </member>\n    </members>\n</doc>\n",
    "orbyss-foundation/feature.json": "{\n  \"schemaVersion\": 2,\n  \"packageId\": \"Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials\",\n  \"features\": [\n    {\n      \"identity\": \"Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials\",\n      \"featureDependencies\": [],\n      \"runtimeDependencies\": [],\n      \"routes\": [],\n      \"dormant\": true,\n      \"composeForOpenApi\": false,\n      \"requiresContractCoverage\": false\n    }\n  ],\n  \"sourceSha256\": {\n    \"ClientCredentialsOptions.cs\": \"b19ebee8f18a6a43a14ee526f6ba839c3b64e499cd3fa9a5f620977b6d81dd4a\",\n    \"ClientCredentialsOptionsValidator.cs\": \"22a4b7dbe5042b68b8590c93aee93462016c3b6b7b92ac3877599ed91896ce22\",\n    \"ClientCredentialsRegistration.cs\": \"78a2d4f772e537e2cec059368274db11ac559980fe29b135136af46c7aade6ee\",\n    \"ClientCredentialsTokenProvider.cs\": \"1a40fd87e54ec51af42b0627c723371fd879e4f52b2ea9daf13eede2763cdd33\",\n    \"FoundationClientCredentialsFeature.cs\": \"539ca765d151ebb6c0a31ba7104ea7e5269f7bb4277276e581cb5b40f7fdf1dc\",\n    \"IClientCredentialsTokenProvider.cs\": \"b7d584d0b493f5933209ae155d1ade49113524040db82f6c305c843bd95787d9\",\n    \"OAuthAccessToken.cs\": \"9a0e8428561080296e32257e46a15c5b9f8b0ba5f4d446669683697266cfc841\"\n  },\n  \"hostProvidedDependencies\": [\n    {\n      \"packageId\": \"CShells.Abstractions\",\n      \"minimumVersion\": \"0.0.30-preview.159\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"packageId\": \"JetBrains.Annotations\",\n      \"minimumVersion\": \"2025.2.4\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n",
    "orbyss-foundation/settings.json": "{\n  \"schemaVersion\": 2,\n  \"packageId\": \"Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials\",\n  \"packageVersion\": \"0.3.1\",\n  \"sourceSha256\": {\n    \"ClientCredentialsOptions.cs\": \"b19ebee8f18a6a43a14ee526f6ba839c3b64e499cd3fa9a5f620977b6d81dd4a\",\n    \"ClientCredentialsOptionsValidator.cs\": \"22a4b7dbe5042b68b8590c93aee93462016c3b6b7b92ac3877599ed91896ce22\",\n    \"ClientCredentialsRegistration.cs\": \"78a2d4f772e537e2cec059368274db11ac559980fe29b135136af46c7aade6ee\",\n    \"ClientCredentialsTokenProvider.cs\": \"1a40fd87e54ec51af42b0627c723371fd879e4f52b2ea9daf13eede2763cdd33\",\n    \"FoundationClientCredentialsFeature.cs\": \"539ca765d151ebb6c0a31ba7104ea7e5269f7bb4277276e581cb5b40f7fdf1dc\",\n    \"IClientCredentialsTokenProvider.cs\": \"b7d584d0b493f5933209ae155d1ade49113524040db82f6c305c843bd95787d9\",\n    \"OAuthAccessToken.cs\": \"9a0e8428561080296e32257e46a15c5b9f8b0ba5f4d446669683697266cfc841\"\n  },\n  \"contracts\": [\n    {\n      \"schemaVersion\": 2,\n      \"owner\": \"Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials\",\n      \"scope\": \"client-credentials\",\n      \"complete\": true,\n      \"sources\": {\n        \"ClientCredentialsOptions.cs\": \"b19ebee8f18a6a43a14ee526f6ba839c3b64e499cd3fa9a5f620977b6d81dd4a\",\n        \"ClientCredentialsOptionsValidator.cs\": \"22a4b7dbe5042b68b8590c93aee93462016c3b6b7b92ac3877599ed91896ce22\",\n        \"ClientCredentialsRegistration.cs\": \"78a2d4f772e537e2cec059368274db11ac559980fe29b135136af46c7aade6ee\",\n        \"ClientCredentialsTokenProvider.cs\": \"1a40fd87e54ec51af42b0627c723371fd879e4f52b2ea9daf13eede2763cdd33\",\n        \"FoundationClientCredentialsFeature.cs\": \"539ca765d151ebb6c0a31ba7104ea7e5269f7bb4277276e581cb5b40f7fdf1dc\",\n        \"IClientCredentialsTokenProvider.cs\": \"b7d584d0b493f5933209ae155d1ade49113524040db82f6c305c843bd95787d9\",\n        \"OAuthAccessToken.cs\": \"9a0e8428561080296e32257e46a15c5b9f8b0ba5f4d446669683697266cfc841\"\n      },\n      \"settings\": [\n        {\n          \"path\": \"Foundation:Authentication:ClientCredentials:Registrations\",\n          \"required\": true,\n          \"secret\": false,\n          \"constraints\": {\n            \"minProperties\": 1\n          },\n          \"binding\": \"The selected shell feature binds this section from ShellSettings.GetConfigurationRoot using the native .NET configuration binder. Options are consumed within that shell provider generation; recompose/restart the shell to replace cached options.\",\n          \"precedence\": [\n            \"typed property initializer\",\n            \"named shell Configuration snapshot\",\n            \"feature settings overlay in native shell composition\",\n            \"explicit registered options configuration in registration order\"\n          ],\n          \"reload\": \"restart\",\n          \"description\": \"Gets registrations keyed by the application-owned token-source name.\",\n          \"type\": \"object\",\n          \"default\": {}\n        }\n      ],\n      \"semanticConstraints\": [\n        \"Endpoints/base addresses must be absolute HTTPS without query/fragment. Loopback HTTP is accepted only in Development with the explicit development override.\",\n        \"Named registration keys must not be blank and are compared ordinally.\",\n        \"Required string settings must not be empty or whitespace.\",\n        \"Configuration is metadata only; token clients and downstream requests are never initialized or executed by export.\",\n        \"Each scope is a nonblank individual OAuth scope value without whitespace; this validator does not require uniqueness.\"\n      ],\n      \"appliesTo\": {\n        \"kind\": \"shell\",\n        \"features\": [\n          \"Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials\"\n        ],\n        \"configuration\": [\n          \"Foundation:Authentication:ClientCredentials\"\n        ]\n      },\n      \"typeName\": \"Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials.ClientCredentialsOptions\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"schemaVersion\": 2,\n      \"owner\": \"Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials\",\n      \"scope\": \"client-credentials-registration\",\n      \"complete\": true,\n      \"sources\": {\n        \"ClientCredentialsOptions.cs\": \"b19ebee8f18a6a43a14ee526f6ba839c3b64e499cd3fa9a5f620977b6d81dd4a\",\n        \"ClientCredentialsOptionsValidator.cs\": \"22a4b7dbe5042b68b8590c93aee93462016c3b6b7b92ac3877599ed91896ce22\",\n        \"ClientCredentialsRegistration.cs\": \"78a2d4f772e537e2cec059368274db11ac559980fe29b135136af46c7aade6ee\",\n        \"ClientCredentialsTokenProvider.cs\": \"1a40fd87e54ec51af42b0627c723371fd879e4f52b2ea9daf13eede2763cdd33\",\n        \"FoundationClientCredentialsFeature.cs\": \"539ca765d151ebb6c0a31ba7104ea7e5269f7bb4277276e581cb5b40f7fdf1dc\",\n        \"IClientCredentialsTokenProvider.cs\": \"b7d584d0b493f5933209ae155d1ade49113524040db82f6c305c843bd95787d9\",\n        \"OAuthAccessToken.cs\": \"9a0e8428561080296e32257e46a15c5b9f8b0ba5f4d446669683697266cfc841\"\n      },\n      \"settings\": [\n        {\n          \"path\": \"Foundation:Authentication:ClientCredentials:Registrations:*:TokenEndpoint\",\n          \"required\": true,\n          \"secret\": false,\n          \"constraints\": {\n            \"format\": \"uri\"\n          },\n          \"binding\": \"The selected shell feature binds this section from ShellSettings.GetConfigurationRoot using the native .NET configuration binder. Options are consumed within that shell provider generation; recompose/restart the shell to replace cached options.\",\n          \"precedence\": [\n            \"typed property initializer\",\n            \"named shell Configuration snapshot\",\n            \"feature settings overlay in native shell composition\",\n            \"explicit registered options configuration in registration order\"\n          ],\n          \"reload\": \"restart\",\n          \"description\": \"Gets or sets the absolute OAuth token endpoint.\",\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"default\": \"\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"Foundation:Authentication:ClientCredentials:Registrations:*:ClientId\",\n          \"required\": true,\n          \"secret\": false,\n          \"constraints\": {\n            \"minLength\": 1\n          },\n          \"binding\": \"The selected shell feature binds this section from ShellSettings.GetConfigurationRoot using the native .NET configuration binder. Options are consumed within that shell provider generation; recompose/restart the shell to replace cached options.\",\n          \"precedence\": [\n            \"typed property initializer\",\n            \"named shell Configuration snapshot\",\n            \"feature settings overlay in native shell composition\",\n            \"explicit registered options configuration in registration order\"\n          ],\n          \"reload\": \"restart\",\n          \"description\": \"Gets or sets the OAuth client identifier.\",\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"default\": \"\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"Foundation:Authentication:ClientCredentials:Registrations:*:ClientSecret\",\n          \"required\": true,\n          \"secret\": true,\n          \"constraints\": {},\n          \"binding\": \"The selected shell feature binds this section from ShellSettings.GetConfigurationRoot using the native .NET configuration binder. Options are consumed within that shell provider generation; recompose/restart the shell to replace cached options.\",\n          \"precedence\": [\n            \"typed property initializer\",\n            \"named shell Configuration snapshot\",\n            \"feature settings overlay in native shell composition\",\n            \"explicit registered options configuration in registration order\"\n          ],\n          \"reload\": \"restart\",\n          \"description\": \"Gets or sets the OAuth client secret supplied by a deployment secret provider.\",\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"Foundation:Authentication:ClientCredentials:Registrations:*:ClientAuthenticationMethod\",\n          \"required\": false,\n          \"secret\": false,\n          \"constraints\": {\n            \"enum\": [\n              \"client_secret_basic\",\n              \"client_secret_post\"\n            ]\n          },\n          \"binding\": \"The selected shell feature binds this section from ShellSettings.GetConfigurationRoot using the native .NET configuration binder. Options are consumed within that shell provider generation; recompose/restart the shell to replace cached options.\",\n          \"precedence\": [\n            \"typed property initializer\",\n            \"named shell Configuration snapshot\",\n            \"feature settings overlay in native shell composition\",\n            \"explicit registered options configuration in registration order\"\n          ],\n          \"reload\": \"restart\",\n          \"description\": \"Gets or sets \\u0060client_secret_basic\\u0060 or \\u0060client_secret_post\\u0060.\",\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"default\": \"client_secret_basic\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"Foundation:Authentication:ClientCredentials:Registrations:*:Scopes\",\n          \"required\": false,\n          \"secret\": false,\n          \"constraints\": {\n            \"items\": {\n              \"type\": \"string\",\n              \"pattern\": \"^\\\\S\\u002B$\"\n            }\n          },\n          \"binding\": \"The selected shell feature binds this section from ShellSettings.GetConfigurationRoot using the native .NET configuration binder. Options are consumed within that shell provider generation; recompose/restart the shell to replace cached options.\",\n          \"precedence\": [\n            \"typed property initializer\",\n            \"named shell Configuration snapshot\",\n            \"feature settings overlay in native shell composition\",\n            \"explicit registered options configuration in registration order\"\n          ],\n          \"reload\": \"restart\",\n          \"description\": \"Gets or sets the exact scopes requested for the machine identity.\",\n          \"type\": \"array\",\n          \"default\": []\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"Foundation:Authentication:ClientCredentials:Registrations:*:RefreshBeforeExpirySeconds\",\n          \"required\": false,\n          \"secret\": false,\n          \"constraints\": {\n            \"minimum\": 0,\n            \"maximum\": 300\n          },\n          \"binding\": \"The selected shell feature binds this section from ShellSettings.GetConfigurationRoot using the native .NET configuration binder. Options are consumed within that shell provider generation; recompose/restart the shell to replace cached options.\",\n          \"precedence\": [\n            \"typed property initializer\",\n            \"named shell Configuration snapshot\",\n            \"feature settings overlay in native shell composition\",\n            \"explicit registered options configuration in registration order\"\n          ],\n          \"reload\": \"restart\",\n          \"description\": \"Gets or sets how early a cached token is refreshed, in seconds.\",\n          \"type\": \"integer\",\n          \"default\": 30\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"Foundation:Authentication:ClientCredentials:Registrations:*:TimeoutSeconds\",\n          \"required\": false,\n          \"secret\": false,\n          \"constraints\": {\n            \"minimum\": 1,\n            \"maximum\": 60\n          },\n          \"binding\": \"The selected shell feature binds this section from ShellSettings.GetConfigurationRoot using the native .NET configuration binder. Options are consumed within that shell provider generation; recompose/restart the shell to replace cached options.\",\n          \"precedence\": [\n            \"typed property initializer\",\n            \"named shell Configuration snapshot\",\n            \"feature settings overlay in native shell composition\",\n            \"explicit registered options configuration in registration order\"\n          ],\n          \"reload\": \"restart\",\n          \"description\": \"Gets or sets the token-endpoint request timeout, in seconds.\",\n          \"type\": \"integer\",\n          \"default\": 10\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"Foundation:Authentication:ClientCredentials:Registrations:*:AllowHttpForLocalDevelopment\",\n          \"required\": false,\n          \"secret\": false,\n          \"constraints\": {},\n          \"binding\": \"The selected shell feature binds this section from ShellSettings.GetConfigurationRoot using the native .NET configuration binder. Options are consumed within that shell provider generation; recompose/restart the shell to replace cached options.\",\n          \"precedence\": [\n            \"typed property initializer\",\n            \"named shell Configuration snapshot\",\n            \"feature settings overlay in native shell composition\",\n            \"explicit registered options configuration in registration order\"\n          ],\n          \"reload\": \"restart\",\n          \"description\": \"Gets or sets whether loopback HTTP is accepted during local development.\",\n          \"type\": \"boolean\",\n          \"default\": false\n        }\n      ],\n      \"semanticConstraints\": [\n        \"Endpoints/base addresses must be absolute HTTPS without query/fragment. Loopback HTTP is accepted only in Development with the explicit development override.\",\n        \"Named registration keys must not be blank and are compared ordinally.\",\n        \"Required string settings must not be empty or whitespace.\",\n        \"Configuration is metadata only; token clients and downstream requests are never initialized or executed by export.\",\n        \"Each scope is a nonblank individual OAuth scope value without whitespace; this validator does not require uniqueness.\"\n      ],\n      \"appliesTo\": {\n        \"kind\": \"shell\",\n        \"features\": [\n          \"Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials\"\n        ],\n        \"configuration\": [\n          \"Foundation:Authentication:ClientCredentials\"\n        ]\n      },\n      \"typeName\": \"Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials.ClientCredentialsRegistration\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"assembly\": {\n    \"name\": \"Orbyss.Foundation.Authentication.ClientCredentials.dll\",\n    \"sha256\": \"642defcc8600e029e333f8e8ad98aa0642344189621fa583bc49564f14ad6e72\"\n  },\n  \"imports\": []\n}\n"
