  },
  "facts": {
    "README.md": "# Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages\n\nAn opt-in CShells feature for a fixed, encoded semantic page, typed public bootstrap, and explicitly\nadmitted public runtime/branding assets. Host stays application-neutral. Requires WebDefaults;\nits dependency is selected by the feature declaration.\n\n## Settings-only consumption\n\nDeploy read-only files below the application content root. Build a Vite library entry exporting\n`async mount(element, bootstrap)`, using relative URLs (`base: \"./\"`) and a manifest. The runtime owns\nform behavior and consumes `bootstrap.formReleaseId`; Foundation does not implement a Forms schema,\nfetch supplier URLs, or add authoring APIs. No raw branding HTML, JS, CSS or SVG is accepted.\n\nCreate a public branding JSON file:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"defaultLocale\": \"en\",\n  \"theme\": \"blue\",\n  \"locales\": {\n    \"en\": {\n      \"title\": \"Estimate your project\",\n      \"purpose\": \"Complete this form to request an estimate.\",\n      \"logoAlt\": \"\",\n      \"loadingText\": \"Loading form\",\n      \"failureText\": \"The form is unavailable. Please try again later.\",\n      \"noScriptText\": \"Enable JavaScript to complete this form.\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\nBuild the explicit deployment manifest with repository tooling:\n\n```console\npython scripts/create_hosted_manifest.py --root path/to/hosted-pages --vite .vite/manifest.json --branding branding.json --entry src/main.ts --revision release-1 --form-release forms-1\n```\n\nThe tool prints the exact settings values. Add them under the shell's\n`Configuration:Foundation:HostedPages`, alongside `Root: \"hosted-pages\"` and `PagePath: \"/\"`.\nEnable `Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages` in that shell's Features map. No consumer middleware or\nConfigureServices registration is needed. The actual Nuplane host must receive the new released\nFoundation packages together; a source merge alone does not make these packages available.\n\nThe loader fetches only the typed public bootstrap, imports the admitted entry and invokes `mount`.\nIt hides the live loading message on success and announces localized text through an alert on failure.\nInitial title, heading and purpose are server-rendered before JavaScript executes. All output contexts\nare encoded; styles come from a built-in stylesheet with blue/green/slate theme tokens. Language selection\nuses Accept-Language quality values, culture parents and the declared fallback. A logo requires alt text\nfor every locale and an explicit branding PNG descriptor.\n\n## Admission and serving contract\n\nThe exact manifest-byte SHA-256 and current revision must match configuration. Activation validates the\nentire current/retained inventory, all static/dynamic Vite imports and CSS/resources, file hashes, MIME/\nextension/content, text/locale bounds and budgets. Assets are copied after validation; request handling\ndoes not read the filesystem. Snapshot-hash URL prefixes preserve emitted relative chunk imports. Use\nrelative CSS font/image URLs too; absolute build-root asset URLs do not follow a shell automatically.\n\nOnly runtime JS, CSS, PNG and WOFF2, and authored branding PNG are supported. Runtime JS/CSS is trusted\ndeployed application code, never user-authored branding. PNG supports non-interlaced 8-bit RGB/RGBA,\nvalidated chunks/CRC/decoded scanlines, at most 8 million pixels, and only IHDR/IDAT/IEND/sRGB/gAMA/pHYs\nchunks. Strip unsupported metadata before deployment. WOFF2 receives header checks; runtime font\nartifacts remain part of the trusted build. Defaults: 2 MB manifest, 8 MB/file, 32 MB total, 16 revisions,\n4096 assets per revision, 32 locales. Total can be raised to 128 MB through settings.\n\nThe local source uses PhysicalFileProvider and refuses linked absolute ancestors and relative paths,\ntraversal, alternate streams, ambiguous filenames and unlisted routes. Deployment directories must be\noperator-controlled and read-only to the serving process. File providers are not a sandbox against an\nattacker who can rewrite deployment roots concurrently; the separately configured manifest hash and\nper-file hashes prevent changed bytes from passing admission.\n\nPublic assets are intentionally anonymous. Each shell maps only its admitted snapshots; knowledge of\nanother shell's intentionally public URL does not make it confidential. Private result downloads and\ntheir authorization/storage remain outside this feature. Unknown/wrong-shell/private references get 404.\nPages and errors are no-store; admitted immutable assets support GET/HEAD, ETags and ranges with accurate\nMIME, nosniff and safe inline filenames. No directory browsing or arbitrary remote fetching occurs.\n\n## Revision retention and providers\n\nChanges require a newly admitted manifest and shell recreation. Use `--retain old-manifest.json` to\ninclude retained revisions whose files are still deployed. Foundation never deletes them. Deployment\ntooling owns removal and rollback. Keep immutable asset paths distinct between revisions. The current\npage refers only to its selected snapshot; retained bootstrap/assets remain available at their hashes.\n\nAn alternative code provider implements IHostedAssetSource.OpenRead and registers it before feature\ncomposition. The same bounded manifest, hash and content admission applies to provider streams.\nIt cannot return arbitrary unvalidated response objects. Production blob/remote ingestion providers,\nSVG, embedding and arbitrary templates are outside this version.\n\nRun `python tests/validate_hosted_pages.py` after the Release build. The HTTP probe uses real CShells;\nthe browser fixture is available through the same probe's `--serve` option.\n",
    "lib/net10.0/Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.xml": "<?xml version=\"1.0\"?>\n<doc>\n    <assembly>\n        <name>Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages</name>\n    </assembly>\n    <members>\n        <member name=\"T:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.AdmittedHostedRevision\">\n            <summary>Holds private activation-owned immutable serving data, never returned to providers.</summary>\n            <param name=\"Definition\">Owned typed manifest revision.</param>\n            <param name=\"Hash\">Hash of the complete revision descriptor.</param>\n            <param name=\"Files\">Copied and validated public bytes.</param>\n            <param name=\"Css\">Transitive static CSS paths.</param>\n            <param name=\"LogoFile\">Optional admitted PNG path.</param>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.AdmittedHostedRevision.#ctor(Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedPageRevision,System.String,System.Collections.Generic.IReadOnlyDictionary{System.String,System.ValueTuple{Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedAssetDescriptor,System.Byte[]}},System.String[],System.String)\">\n            <summary>Holds private activation-owned immutable serving data, never returned to providers.</summary>\n            <param name=\"Definition\">Owned typed manifest revision.</param>\n            <param name=\"Hash\">Hash of the complete revision descriptor.</param>\n            <param name=\"Files\">Copied and validated public bytes.</param>\n            <param name=\"Css\">Transitive static CSS paths.</param>\n            <param name=\"LogoFile\">Optional admitted PNG path.</param>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.AdmittedHostedRevision.Definition\">\n            <summary>Owned typed manifest revision.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.AdmittedHostedRevision.Hash\">\n            <summary>Hash of the complete revision descriptor.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.AdmittedHostedRevision.Files\">\n            <summary>Copied and validated public bytes.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.AdmittedHostedRevision.Css\">\n            <summary>Transitive static CSS paths.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.AdmittedHostedRevision.LogoFile\">\n            <summary>Optional admitted PNG path.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"T:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.FoundationHostedPagesFeature\">\n            <summary>Maps fixed public semantic pages and admitted immutable assets within one shell.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.FoundationHostedPagesFeature.#ctor(CShells.ShellSettings)\">\n            <summary>Maps fixed public semantic pages and admitted immutable assets within one shell.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"F:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.FoundationHostedPagesFeature.routeNamespace\">\n            <summary>Names this shell instance's endpoints uniquely for framework URL generation.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.FoundationHostedPagesFeature.ConfigureServices(Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection.IServiceCollection)\">\n            <inheritdoc />\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.FoundationHostedPagesFeature.MapEndpoints(Microsoft.AspNetCore.Routing.IEndpointRouteBuilder,Microsoft.Extensions.Hosting.IHostEnvironment)\">\n            <inheritdoc />\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.FoundationHostedPagesFeature.MapAsset(Microsoft.AspNetCore.Routing.IEndpointRouteBuilder,System.String,System.Byte[],System.String,System.String)\">\n            <summary>Maps copied immutable bytes with safe names, conditional responses, and explicit public admission.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.FoundationHostedPagesFeature.PublicPath(Microsoft.AspNetCore.Http.HttpContext,System.String)\">\n            <summary>Uses actual mapped route prefixes instead of assuming CShells sets Request.PathBase.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"T:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedAssetAdmission\">\n            <summary>Bounds and validates asset identity, bytes and media type before any route is published.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedAssetAdmission.ValidatePath(System.String)\">\n            <summary>Validates unambiguous literal relative paths across Windows and Unix.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedAssetAdmission.Read(Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.IHostedAssetSource,System.String,System.String,System.Int32)\">\n            <summary>Reads a bounded stream and checks the deployment's admitted hash.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedAssetAdmission.ValidateContent(Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedAssetDescriptor,System.Byte[])\">\n            <summary>Checks content type against extension and distinct runtime/branding admission rules.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedAssetAdmission.SafePath\">\n            <remarks>\n            Pattern:<br/>\n            <code>^[A-Za-z0-9_-][A-Za-z0-9_.-]*(/[A-Za-z0-9_-][A-Za-z0-9_.-]*)*$</code><br/>\n            Options:<br/>\n            <code>RegexOptions.CultureInvariant</code><br/>\n            Explanation:<br/>\n            <code>\n            \u25cb Match if at the beginning of the string.<br/>\n            \u25cb Match a character in the set [\\-0-9A-Z_a-z].<br/>\n            \u25cb Match a character in the set [\\-.0-9A-Z_a-z] greedily any number of times.<br/>\n            \u25cb Loop greedily any number of times.<br/>\n                \u25cb 1st capture group.<br/>\n                    \u25cb Match '/'.<br/>\n                    \u25cb Match a character in the set [\\-0-9A-Z_a-z].<br/>\n                    \u25cb Match a character in the set [\\-.0-9A-Z_a-z] atomically any number of times.<br/>\n            \u25cb Match if at the end of the string or if before an ending newline.<br/>\n            </code>\n            </remarks>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"T:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedAssetDescriptor\">\n            <summary>Declares one public asset; authored branding and trusted executable runtime files are distinct.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedAssetDescriptor.Id\">\n            <summary>Gets an opaque public asset identity.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedAssetDescriptor.File\">\n            <summary>Gets its literal root-relative deployment path.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedAssetDescriptor.Kind\">\n            <summary>Gets runtime or branding trust classification.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedAssetDescriptor.Visibility\">\n            <summary>Gets the explicit public visibility marker.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedAssetDescriptor.ContentType\">\n            <summary>Gets the admitted media type.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedAssetDescriptor.Sha256\">\n            <summary>Gets the expected SHA-256 of exact served bytes.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"T:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedBrandLocale\">\n            <summary>Contains only encoded public semantic and accessible text.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedBrandLocale.Title\">\n            <summary>Gets the page title and heading.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedBrandLocale.Purpose\">\n            <summary>Gets the initial semantic purpose and description.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedBrandLocale.LogoAlt\">\n            <summary>Gets localized logo alternative text, required when a logo is selected.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedBrandLocale.LoadingText\">\n            <summary>Gets the accessible loading message.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedBrandLocale.FailureText\">\n            <summary>Gets the accessible runtime failure message.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedBrandLocale.NoScriptText\">\n            <summary>Gets the no-JavaScript explanation.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"T:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedPageCatalog\">\n            <summary>Admits a coherent public deployment before its routes become available.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"F:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedPageCatalog.ManifestProfile\">\n            <summary>Stores the bounded strict manifest profile.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedPageCatalog.PagePath\">\n            <summary>Gets the shell-local page path.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedPageCatalog.CurrentRevision\">\n            <summary>Gets the current revision identity.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedPageCatalog.Revisions\">\n            <summary>Gets admitted retained revisions with owned byte snapshots.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedPageCatalog.#ctor(Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedPageOptions,Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.IHostedAssetSource)\">\n            <summary>Validates settings, text, graph, budgets, files and hashes before publishing any endpoint.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedPageCatalog.RequireRuntime(System.Collections.Generic.Dictionary{System.String,System.ValueTuple{Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedAssetDescriptor,System.Byte[]}},System.String)\">\n            <summary>Requires an admitted trusted runtime dependency.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedPageCatalog.VisitCss(Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedPageRevision,System.String,System.Collections.Generic.HashSet{System.String},System.Collections.Generic.List{System.String})\">\n            <summary>Collects recursively imported static CSS, retaining deterministic manifest ordering.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedPageCatalog.ValidateId(System.String)\">\n            <summary>Restricts public identities to opaque ASCII tokens.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"T:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedPageManifest\">\n            <summary>Declares the complete current and retained public deployment revisions.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedPageManifest.Version\">\n            <summary>Gets or sets the supported manifest schema version.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedPageManifest.CurrentRevision\">\n            <summary>Gets or sets the current revision, matching application settings.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedPageManifest.Revisions\">\n            <summary>Gets or sets the explicit retained revision inventory.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"T:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedPageOptions\">\n            <summary>Selects one trusted local deployment and its exact admitted manifest.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedPageOptions.Root\">\n            <summary>Gets or sets the read-only deployment root relative to application content root.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedPageOptions.Manifest\">\n            <summary>Gets or sets the manifest filename inside the deployment root.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedPageOptions.ManifestSha256\">\n            <summary>Gets or sets the SHA-256 of the exact manifest bytes; required for coherent admission.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedPageOptions.CurrentRevision\">\n            <summary>Gets or sets the configured current revision, which must agree with the manifest.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedPageOptions.PagePath\">\n            <summary>Gets or sets the literal shell-local page route.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedPageOptions.MaxTotalBytes\">\n            <summary>Gets or sets the aggregate retained asset byte budget, capped at 128 MiB.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"T:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedPageRendering\">\n            <summary>Renders the fixed semantic page with context-encoded data and a CSP-compatible external loader.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"F:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedPageRendering.Loader\">\n            <summary>Loads the admitted runtime and reports failures through text-only DOM APIs.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"F:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedPageRendering.Styles\">\n            <summary>Defines constrained layout and branding tokens without authored CSS.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedPageRendering.BuiltInPath(System.String,System.String)\">\n            <summary>Gets a content-addressed built-in asset name.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedPageRendering.AssetPrefix(Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.AdmittedHostedRevision)\">\n            <summary>Creates the revision's hash-addressed asset prefix, preserving relative Vite imports.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedPageRendering.BootstrapPath(Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.AdmittedHostedRevision,System.String)\">\n            <summary>Creates the explicitly public revision/locale bootstrap route.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedPageRendering.SelectLocale(Microsoft.AspNetCore.Http.HttpContext,Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedPageRevision)\">\n            <summary>Selects an admitted locale using HTTP quality weights and culture parents.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedPageRendering.Bootstrap(Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.AdmittedHostedRevision,System.String,System.Func{System.String,System.String})\">\n            <summary>Produces only the public runtime bootstrap projection.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedPageRendering.Page(Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.AdmittedHostedRevision,System.String,System.Func{System.String,System.String})\">\n            <summary>Encodes every text/attribute sink; scripts and styles are only admitted external assets.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedPageRendering.Encode(System.String)\">\n            <summary>Applies HTML text/attribute encoding, never raw markup insertion.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"T:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedPageRevision\">\n            <summary>Declares public page content and one trusted Vite runtime deployment.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedPageRevision.Id\">\n            <summary>Gets the immutable product revision identity.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedPageRevision.FormReleaseId\">\n            <summary>Gets the public Forms release identity passed to the admitted runtime.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedPageRevision.DefaultLocale\">\n            <summary>Gets the deterministic language fallback.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedPageRevision.Locales\">\n            <summary>Gets localized public text; there are no supplier or private fields.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedPageRevision.LogoAssetId\">\n            <summary>Gets an optional admitted branding asset identity.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedPageRevision.Theme\">\n            <summary>Gets the constrained built-in theme token.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedPageRevision.Entry\">\n            <summary>Gets the selected Vite manifest key.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedPageRevision.Vite\">\n            <summary>Gets the typed Vite manifest including all recursively imported chunks.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedPageRevision.Assets\">\n            <summary>Gets the explicitly public file inventory.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"T:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedViteChunk\">\n            <summary>Models Vite backend integration entries without dynamic property walking.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedViteChunk.File\">\n            <summary>Gets the emitted file path.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedViteChunk.Src\">\n            <summary>Gets the optional source path, never used as a serving path.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedViteChunk.Name\">\n            <summary>Gets the optional chunk name.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedViteChunk.Names\">\n            <summary>Gets optional chunk names.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedViteChunk.IsEntry\">\n            <summary>Gets whether this is a build entry.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedViteChunk.IsDynamicEntry\">\n            <summary>Gets whether this is a dynamic entry.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedViteChunk.Imports\">\n            <summary>Gets static imported manifest keys.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedViteChunk.DynamicImports\">\n            <summary>Gets dynamic imported manifest keys.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedViteChunk.Css\">\n            <summary>Gets emitted CSS paths.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedViteChunk.Assets\">\n            <summary>Gets emitted dependent asset paths.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"T:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.IHostedAssetSource\">\n            <summary>Provides read-only deployment streams; every returned byte is independently bounded and hash-checked.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.IHostedAssetSource.OpenRead(System.String)\">\n            <summary>Opens a literal relative manifest or admitted asset path. Browser input is never passed here.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"T:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.LocalHostedAssetSource\">\n            <summary>Uses ASP.NET file providers within a trusted read-only root, refusing linked path ancestors.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"F:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.LocalHostedAssetSource.root\">\n            <summary>Stores the resolved deployment root.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"F:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.LocalHostedAssetSource.provider\">\n            <summary>Stores the framework file provider.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.LocalHostedAssetSource.#ctor(System.String,System.String)\">\n            <summary>Resolves a deployment directory within application content root.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.LocalHostedAssetSource.OpenRead(System.String)\">\n            <inheritdoc />\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.LocalHostedAssetSource.Dispose\">\n            <inheritdoc />\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.LocalHostedAssetSource.RejectLinks(System.String)\">\n            <summary>Refuses reparse points on every absolute ancestor including the root itself.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"T:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.PngAdmission\">\n            <summary>Admits bounded, non-interlaced 8-bit RGB/RGBA PNGs with checked chunks and scanlines.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.PngAdmission.Validate(System.Byte[])\">\n            <summary>Rejects malformed, oversized, appended, or unsupported PNG content before public serving.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.PngAdmission.Crc(System.ReadOnlySpan{System.Byte})\">\n            <summary>Computes the PNG CRC-32 over chunk type and data.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"T:System.Text.RegularExpressions.Generated.SafePath_0\">\n            <summary>Custom <see cref=\"T:System.Text.RegularExpressions.Regex\"/>-derived type for the SafePath method.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"F:System.Text.RegularExpressions.Generated.SafePath_0.Instance\">\n            <summary>Cached, thread-safe singleton instance.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:System.Text.RegularExpressions.Generated.SafePath_0.#ctor\">\n            <summary>Initializes the instance.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"T:System.Text.RegularExpressions.Generated.SafePath_0.RunnerFactory\">\n            <summary>Provides a factory for creating <see cref=\"T:System.Text.RegularExpressions.RegexRunner\"/> instances to be used by methods on <see cref=\"T:System.Text.RegularExpressions.Regex\"/>.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:System.Text.RegularExpressions.Generated.SafePath_0.RunnerFactory.CreateInstance\">\n            <summary>Creates an instance of a <see cref=\"T:System.Text.RegularExpressions.RegexRunner\"/> used by methods on <see cref=\"T:System.Text.RegularExpressions.Regex\"/>.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"T:System.Text.RegularExpressions.Generated.SafePath_0.RunnerFactory.Runner\">\n            <summary>Provides the runner that contains the custom logic implementing the specified regular expression.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:System.Text.RegularExpressions.Generated.SafePath_0.RunnerFactory.Runner.Scan(System.ReadOnlySpan{System.Char})\">\n            <summary>Scan the <paramref name=\"inputSpan\"/> starting from base.runtextstart for the next match.</summary>\n            <param name=\"inputSpan\">The text being scanned by the regular expression.</param>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:System.Text.RegularExpressions.Generated.SafePath_0.RunnerFactory.Runner.TryFindNextPossibleStartingPosition(System.ReadOnlySpan{System.Char})\">\n            <summary>Search <paramref name=\"inputSpan\"/> starting from base.runtextpos for the next location a match could possibly start.</summary>\n            <param name=\"inputSpan\">The text being scanned by the regular expression.</param>\n            <returns>true if a possible match was found; false if no more matches are possible.</returns>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:System.Text.RegularExpressions.Generated.SafePath_0.RunnerFactory.Runner.TryMatchAtCurrentPosition(System.ReadOnlySpan{System.Char})\">\n            <summary>Determine whether <paramref name=\"inputSpan\"/> at base.runtextpos is a match for the regular expression.</summary>\n            <param name=\"inputSpan\">The text being scanned by the regular expression.</param>\n            <returns>true if the regular expression matches at the current position; otherwise, false.</returns>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"T:System.Text.RegularExpressions.Generated.Utilities\">\n            <summary>Helper methods used by generated <see cref=\"T:System.Text.RegularExpressions.Regex\"/>-derived implementations.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"F:System.Text.RegularExpressions.Generated.Utilities.s_defaultTimeout\">\n            <summary>Default timeout value set in <see cref=\"T:System.AppContext\"/>, or <see cref=\"F:System.Text.RegularExpressions.Regex.InfiniteMatchTimeout\"/> if none was set.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"F:System.Text.RegularExpressions.Generated.Utilities.s_hasTimeout\">\n            <summary>Whether <see cref=\"F:System.Text.RegularExpressions.Generated.Utilities.s_defaultTimeout\"/> is non-infinite.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:System.Text.RegularExpressions.Generated.Utilities.StackPush(System.Int32[]@,System.Int32@,System.Int32,System.Int32)\">\n            <summary>Pushes 2 values onto the backtracking stack.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"F:System.Text.RegularExpressions.Generated.Utilities.s_asciiLettersAndDigitsAndDashDotUnderscore\">\n            <summary>Supports searching for characters in or not in \"-.0123456789ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ_abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz\".</summary>\n        </member>\n    </members>\n</doc>\n",
    "orbyss-foundation/feature.json": "{\n  \"schemaVersion\": 2,\n  \"packageId\": \"Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages\",\n  \"features\": [\n    {\n      \"identity\": \"Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages\",\n      \"featureDependencies\": [\n        \"Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults\"\n      ],\n      \"runtimeDependencies\": [],\n      \"routes\": [],\n      \"dormant\": true,\n      \"composeForOpenApi\": false,\n      \"requiresContractCoverage\": false,\n      \"dynamicRoutesFromConfiguration\": true\n    }\n  ],\n  \"sourceSha256\": {\n    \"AdmittedHostedRevision.cs\": \"f82eac4f42d8354bfc38517027dfb980f7fd2f576f260516c6d1a9a4cc7c8bb5\",\n    \"FoundationHostedPagesFeature.cs\": \"a065bdd295399c1ef0b092c50e92dc95f7b9a4b83ddb2a6f58427c44b7e673b9\",\n    \"HostedAssetAdmission.cs\": \"bf0899130f1380befbdc0f36b30e40725a53e144889b56c7fc40bbdd9b4f0160\",\n    \"HostedAssetDescriptor.cs\": \"76e2a21c960803e3c096ad34cba17d5026d0f9c863d5ee8ef1668e9a5ee7a596\",\n    \"HostedBrandLocale.cs\": \"6f6618812a06b83a9f51a388160ef4161c17842f6954187725e31f2b7a1bb737\",\n    \"HostedPageCatalog.cs\": \"7b42ba832d6e0b5b439eb23acdf1eb63bd242dc068e2ac7077ab78a204f1e4e6\",\n    \"HostedPageManifest.cs\": \"7ab1bacb031f69da18e943d01bf9ae213db1e7ed5ac15f4323e5b2c20af5fa00\",\n    \"HostedPageOptions.cs\": \"0c2a53dd33a3a870cbd4caa0cbc75792bff4f18e23fb34263a8941d34cdbe284\",\n    \"HostedPageRendering.cs\": \"4fa65a04fb199bd1f7987732dc48ea82db16aa5038b8cd83f3c9b838c82922da\",\n    \"HostedPageRevision.cs\": \"7e49ce263999d840eaba79542d9d16117e1df546a9f2b8657062ed70c57cb6f7\",\n    \"HostedViteChunk.cs\": \"c2abdb654125efc3fb6b15f82bc81413805e33410c2e2f78c1aa5cb46f31a844\",\n    \"IHostedAssetSource.cs\": \"2ecd704b528cb3a093462fc6e1eea001f3140c5b29a1dac15211f9220a194edd\",\n    \"LocalHostedAssetSource.cs\": \"e317ed0274ab74944ed700b94af890d194b3a16c6410e31ec137213a47db7847\",\n    \"PngAdmission.cs\": \"6760670f76612f94355b2b68141ca2e035178a7b21fa266da613616bf3bd0dd7\"\n  },\n  \"hostProvidedDependencies\": [\n    {\n      \"packageId\": \"CShells.Abstractions\",\n      \"minimumVersion\": \"0.0.30-preview.159\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"packageId\": \"CShells.AspNetCore.Abstractions\",\n      \"minimumVersion\": \"0.0.30-preview.159\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"packageId\": \"JetBrains.Annotations\",\n      \"minimumVersion\": \"2025.2.4\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n",
    "orbyss-foundation/settings.json": "{\n  \"schemaVersion\": 2,\n  \"packageId\": \"Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages\",\n  \"packageVersion\": \"0.3.1\",\n  \"sourceSha256\": {\n    \"AdmittedHostedRevision.cs\": \"f82eac4f42d8354bfc38517027dfb980f7fd2f576f260516c6d1a9a4cc7c8bb5\",\n    \"FoundationHostedPagesFeature.cs\": \"a065bdd295399c1ef0b092c50e92dc95f7b9a4b83ddb2a6f58427c44b7e673b9\",\n    \"HostedAssetAdmission.cs\": \"bf0899130f1380befbdc0f36b30e40725a53e144889b56c7fc40bbdd9b4f0160\",\n    \"HostedAssetDescriptor.cs\": \"76e2a21c960803e3c096ad34cba17d5026d0f9c863d5ee8ef1668e9a5ee7a596\",\n    \"HostedBrandLocale.cs\": \"6f6618812a06b83a9f51a388160ef4161c17842f6954187725e31f2b7a1bb737\",\n    \"HostedPageCatalog.cs\": \"7b42ba832d6e0b5b439eb23acdf1eb63bd242dc068e2ac7077ab78a204f1e4e6\",\n    \"HostedPageManifest.cs\": \"7ab1bacb031f69da18e943d01bf9ae213db1e7ed5ac15f4323e5b2c20af5fa00\",\n    \"HostedPageOptions.cs\": \"0c2a53dd33a3a870cbd4caa0cbc75792bff4f18e23fb34263a8941d34cdbe284\",\n    \"HostedPageRendering.cs\": \"4fa65a04fb199bd1f7987732dc48ea82db16aa5038b8cd83f3c9b838c82922da\",\n    \"HostedPageRevision.cs\": \"7e49ce263999d840eaba79542d9d16117e1df546a9f2b8657062ed70c57cb6f7\",\n    \"HostedViteChunk.cs\": \"c2abdb654125efc3fb6b15f82bc81413805e33410c2e2f78c1aa5cb46f31a844\",\n    \"IHostedAssetSource.cs\": \"2ecd704b528cb3a093462fc6e1eea001f3140c5b29a1dac15211f9220a194edd\",\n    \"LocalHostedAssetSource.cs\": \"e317ed0274ab74944ed700b94af890d194b3a16c6410e31ec137213a47db7847\",\n    \"PngAdmission.cs\": \"6760670f76612f94355b2b68141ca2e035178a7b21fa266da613616bf3bd0dd7\"\n  },\n  \"contracts\": [\n    {\n      \"schemaVersion\": 2,\n      \"owner\": \"Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages\",\n      \"scope\": \"hosted-pages\",\n      \"complete\": true,\n      \"sources\": {\n        \"AdmittedHostedRevision.cs\": \"f82eac4f42d8354bfc38517027dfb980f7fd2f576f260516c6d1a9a4cc7c8bb5\",\n        \"FoundationHostedPagesFeature.cs\": \"a065bdd295399c1ef0b092c50e92dc95f7b9a4b83ddb2a6f58427c44b7e673b9\",\n        \"HostedAssetAdmission.cs\": \"bf0899130f1380befbdc0f36b30e40725a53e144889b56c7fc40bbdd9b4f0160\",\n        \"HostedAssetDescriptor.cs\": \"76e2a21c960803e3c096ad34cba17d5026d0f9c863d5ee8ef1668e9a5ee7a596\",\n        \"HostedBrandLocale.cs\": \"6f6618812a06b83a9f51a388160ef4161c17842f6954187725e31f2b7a1bb737\",\n        \"HostedPageCatalog.cs\": \"7b42ba832d6e0b5b439eb23acdf1eb63bd242dc068e2ac7077ab78a204f1e4e6\",\n        \"HostedPageManifest.cs\": \"7ab1bacb031f69da18e943d01bf9ae213db1e7ed5ac15f4323e5b2c20af5fa00\",\n        \"HostedPageOptions.cs\": \"0c2a53dd33a3a870cbd4caa0cbc75792bff4f18e23fb34263a8941d34cdbe284\",\n        \"HostedPageRendering.cs\": \"4fa65a04fb199bd1f7987732dc48ea82db16aa5038b8cd83f3c9b838c82922da\",\n        \"HostedPageRevision.cs\": \"7e49ce263999d840eaba79542d9d16117e1df546a9f2b8657062ed70c57cb6f7\",\n        \"HostedViteChunk.cs\": \"c2abdb654125efc3fb6b15f82bc81413805e33410c2e2f78c1aa5cb46f31a844\",\n        \"IHostedAssetSource.cs\": \"2ecd704b528cb3a093462fc6e1eea001f3140c5b29a1dac15211f9220a194edd\",\n        \"LocalHostedAssetSource.cs\": \"e317ed0274ab74944ed700b94af890d194b3a16c6410e31ec137213a47db7847\",\n        \"PngAdmission.cs\": \"6760670f76612f94355b2b68141ca2e035178a7b21fa266da613616bf3bd0dd7\"\n      },\n      \"settings\": [\n        {\n          \"path\": \"Foundation:HostedPages:Root\",\n          \"required\": false,\n          \"secret\": false,\n          \"constraints\": {},\n          \"binding\": \"Shell configuration binds Foundation:HostedPages to HostedPageOptions; native owner validation admits the resulting values.\",\n          \"precedence\": [\n            \"typed source initializer\",\n            \"ordered shell configuration providers\",\n            \"code configuration registered after binding\"\n          ],\n          \"reload\": \"restart\",\n          \"description\": \"Supported Root value owned by HostedPageOptions.\",\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"default\": \"hosted-pages\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"Foundation:HostedPages:Manifest\",\n          \"required\": false,\n          \"secret\": false,\n          \"constraints\": {},\n          \"binding\": \"Shell configuration binds Foundation:HostedPages to HostedPageOptions; native owner validation admits the resulting values.\",\n          \"precedence\": [\n            \"typed source initializer\",\n            \"ordered shell configuration providers\",\n            \"code configuration registered after binding\"\n          ],\n          \"reload\": \"restart\",\n          \"description\": \"Supported Manifest value owned by HostedPageOptions.\",\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"default\": \"manifest.json\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"Foundation:HostedPages:ManifestSha256\",\n          \"required\": true,\n          \"secret\": false,\n          \"constraints\": {\n            \"pattern\": \"^[a-fA-F0-9]{64}$\"\n          },\n          \"binding\": \"Shell configuration binds Foundation:HostedPages to HostedPageOptions; native owner validation admits the resulting values.\",\n          \"precedence\": [\n            \"typed source initializer\",\n            \"ordered shell configuration providers\",\n            \"code configuration registered after binding\"\n          ],\n          \"reload\": \"restart\",\n          \"description\": \"Supported ManifestSha256 value owned by HostedPageOptions.\",\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"default\": \"\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"Foundation:HostedPages:CurrentRevision\",\n          \"required\": true,\n          \"secret\": false,\n          \"constraints\": {},\n          \"binding\": \"Shell configuration binds Foundation:HostedPages to HostedPageOptions; native owner validation admits the resulting values.\",\n          \"precedence\": [\n            \"typed source initializer\",\n            \"ordered shell configuration providers\",\n            \"code configuration registered after binding\"\n          ],\n          \"reload\": \"restart\",\n          \"description\": \"Supported CurrentRevision value owned by HostedPageOptions.\",\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"default\": \"\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"Foundation:HostedPages:PagePath\",\n          \"required\": false,\n          \"secret\": false,\n          \"constraints\": {},\n          \"binding\": \"Shell configuration binds Foundation:HostedPages to HostedPageOptions; native owner validation admits the resulting values.\",\n          \"precedence\": [\n            \"typed source initializer\",\n            \"ordered shell configuration providers\",\n            \"code configuration registered after binding\"\n          ],\n          \"reload\": \"restart\",\n          \"description\": \"Supported PagePath value owned by HostedPageOptions.\",\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"default\": \"/\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"Foundation:HostedPages:MaxTotalBytes\",\n          \"required\": false,\n          \"secret\": false,\n          \"constraints\": {\n            \"minimum\": 1,\n            \"maximum\": 128000000\n          },\n          \"binding\": \"Shell configuration binds Foundation:HostedPages to HostedPageOptions; native owner validation admits the resulting values.\",\n          \"precedence\": [\n            \"typed source initializer\",\n            \"ordered shell configuration providers\",\n            \"code configuration registered after binding\"\n          ],\n          \"reload\": \"restart\",\n          \"description\": \"Supported MaxTotalBytes value owned by HostedPageOptions.\",\n          \"type\": \"integer\",\n          \"default\": 32000000\n        }\n      ],\n      \"semanticConstraints\": [\n        \"Root and Manifest must resolve to admitted contained local read-only paths; symlinks and traversal reject.\",\n        \"Exact manifest SHA256, current revision and runtime publication/asset identities must agree before endpoint registration. Metadata export does not read deployment assets.\",\n        \"PagePath must be a fixed local absolute route; source validators govern safe manifest and aggregate retained byte admission.\"\n      ],\n      \"appliesTo\": {\n        \"kind\": \"shell\",\n        \"features\": [\n          \"Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages\"\n        ],\n        \"configuration\": [\n          \"Foundation:HostedPages\"\n        ]\n      },\n      \"typeName\": \"Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.HostedPageOptions\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"assembly\": {\n    \"name\": \"Orbyss.Foundation.Web.HostedPages.dll\",\n    \"sha256\": \"b7ee090099f0de48150a21ffb7be9505c0a6ba03cfb3e2e1e14ee6abefbbc06f\"\n  },\n  \"imports\": []\n}\n"
  }
