  "facts": {
    "README.md": "# Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults\n\n`Foundation:Web:SupportedLocales` replaces the fallback locale list when explicitly configured.\nOmission retains `[\"en\"]`; an explicit selection must be a non-empty indexed array of distinct,\nnon-empty culture names and contain `DefaultLocale` (which itself defaults to `en`). Set both\n`DefaultLocale: \"nl\"` and `SupportedLocales: [\"nl\", \"de\"]` to enable only Dutch and German.\nEmpty, null and malformed selections fail validation. Configuration-provider precedence applies\nbefore binding; recreate the shell to apply changes.\n\nAn optional CShells middleware feature providing Orbyss Foundation's default correlation identifier,\nbrowser-security response headers, localization, and production HSTS behavior. Consumers can\ndeactivate this feature and activate their own equivalent middleware feature.\n\n## Named response policies\n\nSelect the feature and configure the shell's `Configuration:Foundation:Web:ResponsePolicies`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"DefaultPolicy\": \"default\",\n  \"Policies\": {\n    \"default\": {\n      \"ContentSecurityPolicy\": \"default-src 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'\",\n      \"ReferrerPolicy\": \"same-origin\",\n      \"PermissionsPolicy\": \"camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()\",\n      \"AllowIndexing\": false\n    }\n  },\n  \"FeaturePolicies\": { \"My.PublicPage\": \"default\" }\n}\n```\n\nThe built-in `default`, `private`, and `public-asset` policies preserve framing and object restrictions.\nConfiguration is compiled once per shell activation. Restart/recreate the shell to apply changes.\nInvalid settings fail activation under the Host's existing activation-failure policy; no permissive fallback is used.\nApplication settings are inherited through CShells configuration, then shell settings override them.\n\nFeatures attach `WebResponseMetadata(Feature: \"My.PublicPage\")` to their route group. An endpoint may\nselect a complete policy with `WebResponseMetadata(Policy: \"public-asset\", ImmutablePublicAsset: true)`.\nPrecedence is endpoint selection, feature selection, shell default, Foundation default. Conflicting\nendpoint selections or feature owners are rejected. This is explicit endpoint ownership, not reflection\nover handler types. Mark private responses with `Private: true` regardless of authentication metadata.\nMapped selectors are checked when endpoint sources are available during pipeline construction. A selector\nintroduced later that cannot resolve fails closed with `web_policy_invalid`, default security headers and\nno-store; its handler never runs.\n\nOne response-start writer owns CSP, framing, nosniff, referrer, Permissions-Policy and cache headers.\nPrivate responses, errors, unclassified/static middleware responses and responses with cookies are\n`no-store`. Only explicitly admitted immutable public GET/HEAD resources with status 200/206/304 get\npublic caching. Resource `NoIndex` and policy denial override indexing permission. Discovery retains\nits standalone protection when this feature is not selected. Request authorization and same-origin\nadmission remain independent. Shell policies cover requests inside that shell pipeline, not proxy or\npre-shell failures. Embedding, unsafe-inline and unsafe-eval policies are not supported.\n\nRun `python tests/validate_web_policies.py` after the Release solution build. Its real CShells probe\nexercises two isolated policy catalogs, error response clearing, endpoint overrides, private responses,\npublic caching and header conflicts.\n",
    "lib/net10.0/Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.xml": "<?xml version=\"1.0\"?>\n<doc>\n    <assembly>\n        <name>Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults</name>\n    </assembly>\n    <members>\n        <member name=\"T:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.CorrelationAndSecurityHeadersMiddleware\">\n            <summary>Establishes safe correlation and browser-security response headers.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.CorrelationAndSecurityHeadersMiddleware.#ctor(Microsoft.AspNetCore.Http.RequestDelegate)\">\n            <summary>Establishes safe correlation and browser-security response headers.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"F:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.CorrelationAndSecurityHeadersMiddleware.HeaderName\">\n            <summary>Names the accepted and returned request-correlation header.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.CorrelationAndSecurityHeadersMiddleware.InvokeAsync(Microsoft.AspNetCore.Http.HttpContext,Microsoft.Extensions.Logging.ILogger{Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.CorrelationAndSecurityHeadersMiddleware})\">\n            <summary>Validates correlation input, creates a logging scope, and emits security headers.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.CorrelationAndSecurityHeadersMiddleware.CorrelationIdPattern\">\n            <remarks>\n            Pattern:<br/>\n            <code>^[A-Za-z0-9._-]{1,64}$</code><br/>\n            Options:<br/>\n            <code>RegexOptions.CultureInvariant</code><br/>\n            Explanation:<br/>\n            <code>\n            \u25cb Match if at the beginning of the string.<br/>\n            \u25cb Match a character in the set [\\-.0-9A-Z_a-z] atomically at least 1 and at most 64 times.<br/>\n            \u25cb Match if at the end of the string or if before an ending newline.<br/>\n            </code>\n            </remarks>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"T:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.FoundationWebDefaultsFeature\">\n            <summary>Composes Orbyss Foundation's replaceable web middleware defaults into a shell.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.FoundationWebDefaultsFeature.#ctor(CShells.ShellSettings)\">\n            <summary>Composes Orbyss Foundation's replaceable web middleware defaults into a shell.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"F:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.FoundationWebDefaultsFeature.CorrelationHeaderName\">\n            <summary>Names the correlation header emitted by the default web feature.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.FoundationWebDefaultsFeature.Order\">\n            <inheritdoc />\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.FoundationWebDefaultsFeature.ConfigureServices(Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection.IServiceCollection)\">\n            <inheritdoc />\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.FoundationWebDefaultsFeature.UseMiddleware(Microsoft.AspNetCore.Builder.IApplicationBuilder,Microsoft.Extensions.Hosting.IHostEnvironment)\">\n            <inheritdoc />\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"T:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.FoundationWebDefaultsOptions\">\n            <summary>Defines the localizations enabled by the default Orbyss Foundation web middleware.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.FoundationWebDefaultsOptions.DefaultLocale\">\n            <summary>Gets or sets the deterministic application fallback locale.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.FoundationWebDefaultsOptions.SupportedLocales\">\n            <summary>Gets or sets the application locales accepted by request localization.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"T:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.FoundationWebDefaultsOptionsValidator\">\n            <summary>Rejects an incomplete or invalid locale set.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.FoundationWebDefaultsOptionsValidator.Validate(System.String,Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.FoundationWebDefaultsOptions)\">\n            <inheritdoc />\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"T:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.WebResponseMetadata\">\n            <summary>Selects a complete policy and describes explicit resource admission.</summary>\n            <param name=\"Policy\">Optional named endpoint policy.</param>\n            <param name=\"Feature\">Optional owning feature identity for settings selection.</param>\n            <param name=\"Private\">Whether this response must never be publicly cached or indexed.</param>\n            <param name=\"ImmutablePublicAsset\">Whether immutable public content was explicitly admitted.</param>\n            <param name=\"NoIndex\">Whether resource-specific indexing is forbidden.</param>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.WebResponseMetadata.#ctor(System.String,System.String,System.Boolean,System.Boolean,System.Boolean)\">\n            <summary>Selects a complete policy and describes explicit resource admission.</summary>\n            <param name=\"Policy\">Optional named endpoint policy.</param>\n            <param name=\"Feature\">Optional owning feature identity for settings selection.</param>\n            <param name=\"Private\">Whether this response must never be publicly cached or indexed.</param>\n            <param name=\"ImmutablePublicAsset\">Whether immutable public content was explicitly admitted.</param>\n            <param name=\"NoIndex\">Whether resource-specific indexing is forbidden.</param>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.WebResponseMetadata.Policy\">\n            <summary>Optional named endpoint policy.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.WebResponseMetadata.Feature\">\n            <summary>Optional owning feature identity for settings selection.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.WebResponseMetadata.Private\">\n            <summary>Whether this response must never be publicly cached or indexed.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.WebResponseMetadata.ImmutablePublicAsset\">\n            <summary>Whether immutable public content was explicitly admitted.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.WebResponseMetadata.NoIndex\">\n            <summary>Whether resource-specific indexing is forbidden.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"T:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.WebResponsePoliciesMiddleware\">\n            <summary>Owns final response policies within one shell pipeline.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"F:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.WebResponsePoliciesMiddleware.next\">\n            <summary>Stores the downstream pipeline.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"F:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.WebResponsePoliciesMiddleware.catalog\">\n            <summary>Stores the immutable shell catalog.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.WebResponsePoliciesMiddleware.#ctor(Microsoft.AspNetCore.Http.RequestDelegate,Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.WebResponsePolicyCatalog,System.Collections.Generic.IEnumerable{Microsoft.AspNetCore.Routing.EndpointDataSource})\">\n            <summary>Validates mapped endpoint selectors and captures the shell catalog.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.WebResponsePoliciesMiddleware.InvokeAsync(Microsoft.AspNetCore.Http.HttpContext)\">\n            <summary>Registers final header ownership before downstream middleware can clear a response.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"T:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.WebResponsePoliciesOptions\">\n            <summary>Binds named policies and whole-policy selectors under Foundation:Web:ResponsePolicies.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"F:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.WebResponsePoliciesOptions.SectionName\">\n            <summary>Identifies the shell configuration section.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.WebResponsePoliciesOptions.DefaultPolicy\">\n            <summary>Gets or sets the default policy identity.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.WebResponsePoliciesOptions.Policies\">\n            <summary>Gets or sets complete named policies.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.WebResponsePoliciesOptions.FeaturePolicies\">\n            <summary>Gets or sets policy identities selected by endpoint feature ownership.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"T:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.WebResponsePolicy\">\n            <summary>Holds one immutable validated response policy.</summary>\n            <param name=\"ContentSecurityPolicy\">Validated CSP.</param>\n            <param name=\"ReferrerPolicy\">Validated referrer policy.</param>\n            <param name=\"PermissionsPolicy\">Validated capabilities policy.</param>\n            <param name=\"PublicAssetMaxAgeSeconds\">Public immutable asset freshness.</param>\n            <param name=\"AllowIndexing\">Whether indexing is permitted.</param>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.WebResponsePolicy.#ctor(System.String,System.String,System.String,System.Int32,System.Boolean)\">\n            <summary>Holds one immutable validated response policy.</summary>\n            <param name=\"ContentSecurityPolicy\">Validated CSP.</param>\n            <param name=\"ReferrerPolicy\">Validated referrer policy.</param>\n            <param name=\"PermissionsPolicy\">Validated capabilities policy.</param>\n            <param name=\"PublicAssetMaxAgeSeconds\">Public immutable asset freshness.</param>\n            <param name=\"AllowIndexing\">Whether indexing is permitted.</param>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.WebResponsePolicy.ContentSecurityPolicy\">\n            <summary>Validated CSP.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.WebResponsePolicy.ReferrerPolicy\">\n            <summary>Validated referrer policy.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.WebResponsePolicy.PermissionsPolicy\">\n            <summary>Validated capabilities policy.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.WebResponsePolicy.PublicAssetMaxAgeSeconds\">\n            <summary>Public immutable asset freshness.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.WebResponsePolicy.AllowIndexing\">\n            <summary>Whether indexing is permitted.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"T:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.WebResponsePolicyCatalog\">\n            <summary>Compiles shell-local settings into immutable, validated policies.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"F:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.WebResponsePolicyCatalog.policies\">\n            <summary>Stores copied policies.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"F:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.WebResponsePolicyCatalog.features\">\n            <summary>Stores copied feature selections.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"F:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.WebResponsePolicyCatalog.defaultPolicy\">\n            <summary>Stores the default selection.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.WebResponsePolicyCatalog.#ctor(Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.WebResponsePoliciesOptions)\">\n            <summary>Compiles the complete configuration or rejects it before serving requests.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.WebResponsePolicyCatalog.Resolve(Microsoft.AspNetCore.Http.Endpoint)\">\n            <summary>Resolves endpoint, feature, and shell selections without merging header fields.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.WebResponsePolicyCatalog.Validate(System.String,Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.WebResponsePolicyOptions)\">\n            <summary>Rejects injected or contradictory settings without echoing authored values.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.WebResponsePolicyCatalog.Invalid(System.String,System.String)\">\n            <summary>Creates a deterministic configuration diagnostic.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"T:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.WebResponsePolicyOptions\">\n            <summary>Defines a complete named response policy; values are copied at shell activation.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.WebResponsePolicyOptions.ContentSecurityPolicy\">\n            <summary>Gets or sets the CSP. Framing and object restrictions are mandatory.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.WebResponsePolicyOptions.ReferrerPolicy\">\n            <summary>Gets or sets the browser referrer policy.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.WebResponsePolicyOptions.PermissionsPolicy\">\n            <summary>Gets or sets the browser capabilities policy.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.WebResponsePolicyOptions.PublicAssetMaxAgeSeconds\">\n            <summary>Gets or sets public asset freshness; zero means no-store.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"P:Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.WebResponsePolicyOptions.AllowIndexing\">\n            <summary>Gets or sets whether search indexing is permitted.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"T:System.Text.RegularExpressions.Generated.CorrelationIdPattern_0\">\n            <summary>Custom <see cref=\"T:System.Text.RegularExpressions.Regex\"/>-derived type for the CorrelationIdPattern method.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"F:System.Text.RegularExpressions.Generated.CorrelationIdPattern_0.Instance\">\n            <summary>Cached, thread-safe singleton instance.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:System.Text.RegularExpressions.Generated.CorrelationIdPattern_0.#ctor\">\n            <summary>Initializes the instance.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"T:System.Text.RegularExpressions.Generated.CorrelationIdPattern_0.RunnerFactory\">\n            <summary>Provides a factory for creating <see cref=\"T:System.Text.RegularExpressions.RegexRunner\"/> instances to be used by methods on <see cref=\"T:System.Text.RegularExpressions.Regex\"/>.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:System.Text.RegularExpressions.Generated.CorrelationIdPattern_0.RunnerFactory.CreateInstance\">\n            <summary>Creates an instance of a <see cref=\"T:System.Text.RegularExpressions.RegexRunner\"/> used by methods on <see cref=\"T:System.Text.RegularExpressions.Regex\"/>.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"T:System.Text.RegularExpressions.Generated.CorrelationIdPattern_0.RunnerFactory.Runner\">\n            <summary>Provides the runner that contains the custom logic implementing the specified regular expression.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:System.Text.RegularExpressions.Generated.CorrelationIdPattern_0.RunnerFactory.Runner.Scan(System.ReadOnlySpan{System.Char})\">\n            <summary>Scan the <paramref name=\"inputSpan\"/> starting from base.runtextstart for the next match.</summary>\n            <param name=\"inputSpan\">The text being scanned by the regular expression.</param>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:System.Text.RegularExpressions.Generated.CorrelationIdPattern_0.RunnerFactory.Runner.TryFindNextPossibleStartingPosition(System.ReadOnlySpan{System.Char})\">\n            <summary>Search <paramref name=\"inputSpan\"/> starting from base.runtextpos for the next location a match could possibly start.</summary>\n            <param name=\"inputSpan\">The text being scanned by the regular expression.</param>\n            <returns>true if a possible match was found; false if no more matches are possible.</returns>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"M:System.Text.RegularExpressions.Generated.CorrelationIdPattern_0.RunnerFactory.Runner.TryMatchAtCurrentPosition(System.ReadOnlySpan{System.Char})\">\n            <summary>Determine whether <paramref name=\"inputSpan\"/> at base.runtextpos is a match for the regular expression.</summary>\n            <param name=\"inputSpan\">The text being scanned by the regular expression.</param>\n            <returns>true if the regular expression matches at the current position; otherwise, false.</returns>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"T:System.Text.RegularExpressions.Generated.Utilities\">\n            <summary>Helper methods used by generated <see cref=\"T:System.Text.RegularExpressions.Regex\"/>-derived implementations.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"F:System.Text.RegularExpressions.Generated.Utilities.s_defaultTimeout\">\n            <summary>Default timeout value set in <see cref=\"T:System.AppContext\"/>, or <see cref=\"F:System.Text.RegularExpressions.Regex.InfiniteMatchTimeout\"/> if none was set.</summary>\n        </member>\n        <member name=\"F:System.Text.RegularExpressions.Generated.Utilities.s_hasTimeout\">\n            <summary>Whether <see cref=\"F:System.Text.RegularExpressions.Generated.Utilities.s_defaultTimeout\"/> is non-infinite.</summary>\n        </member>\n    </members>\n</doc>\n",
    "orbyss-foundation/feature.json": "{\n  \"schemaVersion\": 2,\n  \"packageId\": \"Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults\",\n  \"features\": [\n    {\n      \"identity\": \"Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults\",\n      \"featureDependencies\": [],\n      \"runtimeDependencies\": [],\n      \"routes\": [],\n      \"dormant\": true,\n      \"composeForOpenApi\": false,\n      \"requiresContractCoverage\": false\n    }\n  ],\n  \"sourceSha256\": {\n    \"CorrelationAndSecurityHeadersMiddleware.cs\": \"1f53e2c0e0650b649d5296df3e3f2d31f94ea0b8b14cb25fed8d83534b800150\",\n    \"FoundationWebDefaultsFeature.cs\": \"113313707f353ea3100822d5b07c8f515cbf38060462d43e034140d89b449f10\",\n    \"FoundationWebDefaultsOptions.cs\": \"104cd06d7440c3c26914d7cbffb51a34084898b7bce09eb2808da81692c94450\",\n    \"FoundationWebDefaultsOptionsValidator.cs\": \"9bc58c697dcc37daac0aad65353a77054e2bc618aca3cbf49768dafc3d35abc7\",\n    \"WebResponseMetadata.cs\": \"261b0c3ff52794dec1eabf524ec83725d0d415b21294686c42dc9fc4b8397ae4\",\n    \"WebResponsePoliciesMiddleware.cs\": \"f713bc35fba4b03fcba94407e0fbfe5d0be49ac3d63e86291dbe3aa74e1ea840\",\n    \"WebResponsePoliciesOptions.cs\": \"6812cdd90a47581e4487cd1d04350207804585e9b665aff9be3d3afa9b40e7a0\",\n    \"WebResponsePolicy.cs\": \"a4a1f446cbb5a2dd6037bba5649f42427af80194feadb2f32c4094d47f2643c1\",\n    \"WebResponsePolicyCatalog.cs\": \"50d148698f0167aba22c46af5da4a6e193d3dd453688251e0082df02af3a6806\",\n    \"WebResponsePolicyOptions.cs\": \"077cbff4b433469a0f60d636f73d65a26cd8686ac76259e0b1da973492a10976\"\n  },\n  \"hostProvidedDependencies\": [\n    {\n      \"packageId\": \"CShells.Abstractions\",\n      \"minimumVersion\": \"0.0.30-preview.159\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"packageId\": \"CShells.AspNetCore.Abstractions\",\n      \"minimumVersion\": \"0.0.30-preview.159\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"packageId\": \"JetBrains.Annotations\",\n      \"minimumVersion\": \"2025.2.4\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n",
    "orbyss-foundation/settings.json": "{\n  \"schemaVersion\": 2,\n  \"packageId\": \"Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults\",\n  \"packageVersion\": \"0.3.1\",\n  \"sourceSha256\": {\n    \"CorrelationAndSecurityHeadersMiddleware.cs\": \"1f53e2c0e0650b649d5296df3e3f2d31f94ea0b8b14cb25fed8d83534b800150\",\n    \"FoundationWebDefaultsFeature.cs\": \"113313707f353ea3100822d5b07c8f515cbf38060462d43e034140d89b449f10\",\n    \"FoundationWebDefaultsOptions.cs\": \"104cd06d7440c3c26914d7cbffb51a34084898b7bce09eb2808da81692c94450\",\n    \"FoundationWebDefaultsOptionsValidator.cs\": \"9bc58c697dcc37daac0aad65353a77054e2bc618aca3cbf49768dafc3d35abc7\",\n    \"WebResponseMetadata.cs\": \"261b0c3ff52794dec1eabf524ec83725d0d415b21294686c42dc9fc4b8397ae4\",\n    \"WebResponsePoliciesMiddleware.cs\": \"f713bc35fba4b03fcba94407e0fbfe5d0be49ac3d63e86291dbe3aa74e1ea840\",\n    \"WebResponsePoliciesOptions.cs\": \"6812cdd90a47581e4487cd1d04350207804585e9b665aff9be3d3afa9b40e7a0\",\n    \"WebResponsePolicy.cs\": \"a4a1f446cbb5a2dd6037bba5649f42427af80194feadb2f32c4094d47f2643c1\",\n    \"WebResponsePolicyCatalog.cs\": \"50d148698f0167aba22c46af5da4a6e193d3dd453688251e0082df02af3a6806\",\n    \"WebResponsePolicyOptions.cs\": \"077cbff4b433469a0f60d636f73d65a26cd8686ac76259e0b1da973492a10976\"\n  },\n  \"contracts\": [\n    {\n      \"schemaVersion\": 2,\n      \"owner\": \"Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults\",\n      \"scope\": \"web-localization\",\n      \"complete\": true,\n      \"sources\": {\n        \"CorrelationAndSecurityHeadersMiddleware.cs\": \"1f53e2c0e0650b649d5296df3e3f2d31f94ea0b8b14cb25fed8d83534b800150\",\n        \"FoundationWebDefaultsFeature.cs\": \"113313707f353ea3100822d5b07c8f515cbf38060462d43e034140d89b449f10\",\n        \"FoundationWebDefaultsOptions.cs\": \"104cd06d7440c3c26914d7cbffb51a34084898b7bce09eb2808da81692c94450\",\n        \"FoundationWebDefaultsOptionsValidator.cs\": \"9bc58c697dcc37daac0aad65353a77054e2bc618aca3cbf49768dafc3d35abc7\",\n        \"WebResponseMetadata.cs\": \"261b0c3ff52794dec1eabf524ec83725d0d415b21294686c42dc9fc4b8397ae4\",\n        \"WebResponsePoliciesMiddleware.cs\": \"f713bc35fba4b03fcba94407e0fbfe5d0be49ac3d63e86291dbe3aa74e1ea840\",\n        \"WebResponsePoliciesOptions.cs\": \"6812cdd90a47581e4487cd1d04350207804585e9b665aff9be3d3afa9b40e7a0\",\n        \"WebResponsePolicy.cs\": \"a4a1f446cbb5a2dd6037bba5649f42427af80194feadb2f32c4094d47f2643c1\",\n        \"WebResponsePolicyCatalog.cs\": \"50d148698f0167aba22c46af5da4a6e193d3dd453688251e0082df02af3a6806\",\n        \"WebResponsePolicyOptions.cs\": \"077cbff4b433469a0f60d636f73d65a26cd8686ac76259e0b1da973492a10976\"\n      },\n      \"settings\": [\n        {\n          \"path\": \"Foundation:Web:DefaultLocale\",\n          \"required\": false,\n          \"secret\": false,\n          \"constraints\": {},\n          \"binding\": \"Shell configuration binds Foundation:Web to FoundationWebDefaultsOptions; native owner validation admits the resulting values.\",\n          \"precedence\": [\n            \"typed source initializer\",\n            \"ordered shell configuration providers\",\n            \"code configuration registered after binding\"\n          ],\n          \"reload\": \"restart\",\n          \"description\": \"Supported DefaultLocale value owned by FoundationWebDefaultsOptions.\",\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"default\": \"en\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"Foundation:Web:SupportedLocales\",\n          \"required\": false,\n          \"secret\": false,\n          \"constraints\": {\n            \"minItems\": 1,\n            \"uniqueItems\": true\n          },\n          \"binding\": \"Shell configuration binds Foundation:Web to FoundationWebDefaultsOptions; native owner validation admits the resulting values.\",\n          \"precedence\": [\n            \"typed source initializer\",\n            \"ordered shell configuration providers\",\n            \"code configuration registered after binding\"\n          ],\n          \"reload\": \"restart\",\n          \"description\": \"Supported SupportedLocales value owned by FoundationWebDefaultsOptions.\",\n          \"type\": \"array\",\n          \"default\": [\n            \"en\"\n          ]\n        }\n      ],\n      \"semanticConstraints\": [\n        \"An explicit SupportedLocales selection clears initialized array before binding; empty/null/non-indexed values reject rather than restoring fallback.\",\n        \"SupportedLocales must contain DefaultLocale ignoring case and distinct nonempty CultureInfo-recognized locale names.\"\n      ],\n      \"appliesTo\": {\n        \"kind\": \"shell\",\n        \"features\": [\n          \"Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults\"\n        ],\n        \"configuration\": [\n          \"Foundation:Web:DefaultLocale\",\n          \"Foundation:Web:SupportedLocales\"\n        ]\n      },\n      \"typeName\": \"Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.FoundationWebDefaultsOptions\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"schemaVersion\": 2,\n      \"owner\": \"Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults\",\n      \"scope\": \"web-response-policies\",\n      \"complete\": true,\n      \"sources\": {\n        \"CorrelationAndSecurityHeadersMiddleware.cs\": \"1f53e2c0e0650b649d5296df3e3f2d31f94ea0b8b14cb25fed8d83534b800150\",\n        \"FoundationWebDefaultsFeature.cs\": \"113313707f353ea3100822d5b07c8f515cbf38060462d43e034140d89b449f10\",\n        \"FoundationWebDefaultsOptions.cs\": \"104cd06d7440c3c26914d7cbffb51a34084898b7bce09eb2808da81692c94450\",\n        \"FoundationWebDefaultsOptionsValidator.cs\": \"9bc58c697dcc37daac0aad65353a77054e2bc618aca3cbf49768dafc3d35abc7\",\n        \"WebResponseMetadata.cs\": \"261b0c3ff52794dec1eabf524ec83725d0d415b21294686c42dc9fc4b8397ae4\",\n        \"WebResponsePoliciesMiddleware.cs\": \"f713bc35fba4b03fcba94407e0fbfe5d0be49ac3d63e86291dbe3aa74e1ea840\",\n        \"WebResponsePoliciesOptions.cs\": \"6812cdd90a47581e4487cd1d04350207804585e9b665aff9be3d3afa9b40e7a0\",\n        \"WebResponsePolicy.cs\": \"a4a1f446cbb5a2dd6037bba5649f42427af80194feadb2f32c4094d47f2643c1\",\n        \"WebResponsePolicyCatalog.cs\": \"50d148698f0167aba22c46af5da4a6e193d3dd453688251e0082df02af3a6806\",\n        \"WebResponsePolicyOptions.cs\": \"077cbff4b433469a0f60d636f73d65a26cd8686ac76259e0b1da973492a10976\"\n      },\n      \"settings\": [\n        {\n          \"path\": \"Foundation:Web:ResponsePolicies:DefaultPolicy\",\n          \"required\": false,\n          \"secret\": false,\n          \"constraints\": {},\n          \"binding\": \"Shell configuration binds Foundation:Web:ResponsePolicies to WebResponsePoliciesOptions; native owner validation admits the resulting values.\",\n          \"precedence\": [\n            \"typed source initializer\",\n            \"ordered shell configuration providers\",\n            \"code configuration registered after binding\"\n          ],\n          \"reload\": \"restart\",\n          \"description\": \"Supported DefaultPolicy value owned by WebResponsePoliciesOptions.\",\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"default\": \"default\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"Foundation:Web:ResponsePolicies:Policies\",\n          \"required\": false,\n          \"secret\": false,\n          \"constraints\": {\n            \"maxProperties\": 128\n          },\n          \"binding\": \"Shell configuration binds Foundation:Web:ResponsePolicies to WebResponsePoliciesOptions; native owner validation admits the resulting values.\",\n          \"precedence\": [\n            \"typed source initializer\",\n            \"ordered shell configuration providers\",\n            \"code configuration registered after binding\"\n          ],\n          \"reload\": \"restart\",\n          \"description\": \"Supported Policies value owned by WebResponsePoliciesOptions.\",\n          \"type\": \"object\",\n          \"default\": {\n            \"default\": {\n              \"ContentSecurityPolicy\": \"default-src \\u0027self\\u0027; frame-ancestors \\u0027none\\u0027; object-src \\u0027none\\u0027; base-uri \\u0027self\\u0027\",\n              \"ReferrerPolicy\": \"no-referrer\",\n              \"PermissionsPolicy\": \"camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()\",\n              \"PublicAssetMaxAgeSeconds\": 0,\n              \"AllowIndexing\": false\n            },\n            \"private\": {\n              \"ContentSecurityPolicy\": \"default-src \\u0027self\\u0027; frame-ancestors \\u0027none\\u0027; object-src \\u0027none\\u0027; base-uri \\u0027self\\u0027\",\n              \"ReferrerPolicy\": \"no-referrer\",\n              \"PermissionsPolicy\": \"camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()\",\n              \"PublicAssetMaxAgeSeconds\": 0,\n              \"AllowIndexing\": false\n            },\n            \"public-asset\": {\n              \"ContentSecurityPolicy\": \"default-src \\u0027self\\u0027; frame-ancestors \\u0027none\\u0027; object-src \\u0027none\\u0027; base-uri \\u0027self\\u0027\",\n              \"ReferrerPolicy\": \"no-referrer\",\n              \"PermissionsPolicy\": \"camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()\",\n              \"PublicAssetMaxAgeSeconds\": 31536000,\n              \"AllowIndexing\": false\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"Foundation:Web:ResponsePolicies:FeaturePolicies\",\n          \"required\": false,\n          \"secret\": false,\n          \"constraints\": {},\n          \"binding\": \"Shell configuration binds Foundation:Web:ResponsePolicies to WebResponsePoliciesOptions; native owner validation admits the resulting values.\",\n          \"precedence\": [\n            \"typed source initializer\",\n            \"ordered shell configuration providers\",\n            \"code configuration registered after binding\"\n          ],\n          \"reload\": \"restart\",\n          \"description\": \"Supported FeaturePolicies value owned by WebResponsePoliciesOptions.\",\n          \"type\": \"object\",\n          \"default\": {}\n        }\n      ],\n      \"semanticConstraints\": [\n        \"Policies and feature selectors bind as native string-key dictionaries over initialized source values.\",\n        \"DefaultPolicy and every feature/endpoint selector must resolve an existing complete policy; headers are selected as a whole and not merged across policies.\",\n        \"Named policy keys must be nonempty ASCII letters/digits/dot/hyphen/underscore and at most128 characters.\"\n      ],\n      \"appliesTo\": {\n        \"kind\": \"shell\",\n        \"features\": [\n          \"Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults\"\n        ],\n        \"configuration\": [\n          \"Foundation:Web:ResponsePolicies\"\n        ]\n      },\n      \"typeName\": \"Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.WebResponsePoliciesOptions\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"schemaVersion\": 2,\n      \"owner\": \"Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults\",\n      \"scope\": \"web-response-policy\",\n      \"complete\": true,\n      \"sources\": {\n        \"CorrelationAndSecurityHeadersMiddleware.cs\": \"1f53e2c0e0650b649d5296df3e3f2d31f94ea0b8b14cb25fed8d83534b800150\",\n        \"FoundationWebDefaultsFeature.cs\": \"113313707f353ea3100822d5b07c8f515cbf38060462d43e034140d89b449f10\",\n        \"FoundationWebDefaultsOptions.cs\": \"104cd06d7440c3c26914d7cbffb51a34084898b7bce09eb2808da81692c94450\",\n        \"FoundationWebDefaultsOptionsValidator.cs\": \"9bc58c697dcc37daac0aad65353a77054e2bc618aca3cbf49768dafc3d35abc7\",\n        \"WebResponseMetadata.cs\": \"261b0c3ff52794dec1eabf524ec83725d0d415b21294686c42dc9fc4b8397ae4\",\n        \"WebResponsePoliciesMiddleware.cs\": \"f713bc35fba4b03fcba94407e0fbfe5d0be49ac3d63e86291dbe3aa74e1ea840\",\n        \"WebResponsePoliciesOptions.cs\": \"6812cdd90a47581e4487cd1d04350207804585e9b665aff9be3d3afa9b40e7a0\",\n        \"WebResponsePolicy.cs\": \"a4a1f446cbb5a2dd6037bba5649f42427af80194feadb2f32c4094d47f2643c1\",\n        \"WebResponsePolicyCatalog.cs\": \"50d148698f0167aba22c46af5da4a6e193d3dd453688251e0082df02af3a6806\",\n        \"WebResponsePolicyOptions.cs\": \"077cbff4b433469a0f60d636f73d65a26cd8686ac76259e0b1da973492a10976\"\n      },\n      \"settings\": [\n        {\n          \"path\": \"Foundation:Web:ResponsePolicies:Policies:{policyName}:ContentSecurityPolicy\",\n          \"required\": false,\n          \"secret\": false,\n          \"constraints\": {\n            \"minLength\": 1,\n            \"maxLength\": 8192\n          },\n          \"binding\": \"Shell configuration binds Foundation:Web:ResponsePolicies:Policies:{policyName} to WebResponsePolicyOptions; native owner validation admits the resulting values.\",\n          \"precedence\": [\n            \"typed source initializer\",\n            \"ordered shell configuration providers\",\n            \"code configuration registered after binding\"\n          ],\n          \"reload\": \"restart\",\n          \"description\": \"Supported ContentSecurityPolicy value owned by WebResponsePolicyOptions.\",\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"default\": \"default-src \\u0027self\\u0027; frame-ancestors \\u0027none\\u0027; object-src \\u0027none\\u0027; base-uri \\u0027self\\u0027\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"Foundation:Web:ResponsePolicies:Policies:{policyName}:ReferrerPolicy\",\n          \"required\": false,\n          \"secret\": false,\n          \"constraints\": {\n            \"enum\": [\n              \"no-referrer\",\n              \"same-origin\",\n              \"strict-origin\",\n              \"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\"\n            ]\n          },\n          \"binding\": \"Shell configuration binds Foundation:Web:ResponsePolicies:Policies:{policyName} to WebResponsePolicyOptions; native owner validation admits the resulting values.\",\n          \"precedence\": [\n            \"typed source initializer\",\n            \"ordered shell configuration providers\",\n            \"code configuration registered after binding\"\n          ],\n          \"reload\": \"restart\",\n          \"description\": \"Supported ReferrerPolicy value owned by WebResponsePolicyOptions.\",\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"default\": \"no-referrer\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"Foundation:Web:ResponsePolicies:Policies:{policyName}:PermissionsPolicy\",\n          \"required\": false,\n          \"secret\": false,\n          \"constraints\": {\n            \"minLength\": 1,\n            \"maxLength\": 8192\n          },\n          \"binding\": \"Shell configuration binds Foundation:Web:ResponsePolicies:Policies:{policyName} to WebResponsePolicyOptions; native owner validation admits the resulting values.\",\n          \"precedence\": [\n            \"typed source initializer\",\n            \"ordered shell configuration providers\",\n            \"code configuration registered after binding\"\n          ],\n          \"reload\": \"restart\",\n          \"description\": \"Supported PermissionsPolicy value owned by WebResponsePolicyOptions.\",\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"default\": \"camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"Foundation:Web:ResponsePolicies:Policies:{policyName}:PublicAssetMaxAgeSeconds\",\n          \"required\": false,\n          \"secret\": false,\n          \"constraints\": {\n            \"minimum\": 0,\n            \"maximum\": 31536000\n          },\n          \"binding\": \"Shell configuration binds Foundation:Web:ResponsePolicies:Policies:{policyName} to WebResponsePolicyOptions; native owner validation admits the resulting values.\",\n          \"precedence\": [\n            \"typed source initializer\",\n            \"ordered shell configuration providers\",\n            \"code configuration registered after binding\"\n          ],\n          \"reload\": \"restart\",\n          \"description\": \"Supported PublicAssetMaxAgeSeconds value owned by WebResponsePolicyOptions.\",\n          \"type\": \"integer\",\n          \"default\": 0\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"Foundation:Web:ResponsePolicies:Policies:{policyName}:AllowIndexing\",\n          \"required\": false,\n          \"secret\": false,\n          \"constraints\": {},\n          \"binding\": \"Shell configuration binds Foundation:Web:ResponsePolicies:Policies:{policyName} to WebResponsePolicyOptions; native owner validation admits the resulting values.\",\n          \"precedence\": [\n            \"typed source initializer\",\n            \"ordered shell configuration providers\",\n            \"code configuration registered after binding\"\n          ],\n          \"reload\": \"restart\",\n          \"description\": \"Supported AllowIndexing value owned by WebResponsePolicyOptions.\",\n          \"type\": \"boolean\",\n          \"default\": false\n        }\n      ],\n      \"semanticConstraints\": [\n        \"Headers must contain printable ASCII with no control characters. CSP requires default-src, frame-ancestors none, object-src none and base-uri self/none; unsafe-inline and unsafe-eval are prohibited.\",\n        \"Permissions-Policy grammar and distinct directive identities are enforced by WebResponsePolicyCatalog.\",\n        \"PublicAssetMaxAgeSeconds zero means no-store; caching/indexing remains endpoint/application policy.\"\n      ],\n      \"appliesTo\": {\n        \"kind\": \"shell\",\n        \"features\": [\n          \"Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults\"\n        ],\n        \"configuration\": [\n          \"Foundation:Web:ResponsePolicies:Policies\"\n        ]\n      },\n      \"typeName\": \"Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.WebResponsePolicyOptions\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"assembly\": {\n    \"name\": \"Orbyss.Foundation.WebDefaults.dll\",\n    \"sha256\": \"25cd28e52cef17b50a91bb0dc8a7a8bb919f135b10637b23ff9ff0307a344d31\"\n  },\n  \"imports\": []\n}\n"
